1
00:00:16,016 --> 00:00:19,920
{\an8}[narrator] <i>The winner of</i> I Am Boxer <i>will
receive a grand prize of 300 million</i>

2
00:00:19,987 --> 00:00:23,223
{\an8}<i>and a top-of-the-line flagship SUV.</i>

3
00:00:26,527 --> 00:00:27,828
[Bivol, in English] <i>I Am Boxer.</i>

4
00:00:27,895 --> 00:00:29,429
This fight is

5
00:00:29,496 --> 00:00:31,131
Three-Man Battle.

6
00:00:31,198 --> 00:00:33,267
[Youngho, in Korean]
A three-way fight? Geez.

7
00:00:33,333 --> 00:00:35,302
- You're doing awesome!
- Push harder!

8
00:00:35,369 --> 00:00:36,503
Time's almost up!

9
00:00:37,070 --> 00:00:38,238
[Bivol] He's a crazy guy.

10
00:00:38,305 --> 00:00:40,240
Congratulations to the five fighters

11
00:00:40,307 --> 00:00:42,476
who survived the Three-Man Battle.

12
00:00:44,344 --> 00:00:45,412
[Youngho] <i>So it's not over yet.</i>

13
00:00:45,479 --> 00:00:47,381
[Jongkook] <i>Man, this will be tough.</i>

14
00:00:47,447 --> 00:00:49,082
This deathmatch is

15
00:00:49,149 --> 00:00:50,651
The Tire Brawl.

16
00:00:51,151 --> 00:00:54,321
[Jongkook] Both fighters will have
one foot placed in the tire

17
00:00:54,388 --> 00:00:55,856
and box it out from there.

18
00:00:56,823 --> 00:00:57,824
I think we should stop.

19
00:00:57,891 --> 00:01:00,294
[Jongkook] The fight will go on

20
00:01:00,360 --> 00:01:02,162
until the Master calls it.

21
00:01:02,729 --> 00:01:04,131
Should a KO occur,

22
00:01:04,197 --> 00:01:07,534
your survival or elimination
will be decided on the spot.

23
00:01:09,570 --> 00:01:12,706
{\an8}- [Bivol] There's a 21-kilo difference.
- [Don] Twenty-one? Wow.

24
00:01:12,773 --> 00:01:14,207
{\an8}That's a bit of a gap.

25
00:01:14,274 --> 00:01:15,509
{\an8}KUK SEUNGJUN VS PARK YOUNGHO

26
00:01:15,576 --> 00:01:18,045
Honestly, I felt confident. No joke.

27
00:01:18,111 --> 00:01:20,781
I've fought against Kuk Seungjun before.

28
00:01:20,847 --> 00:01:24,318
<i>I could see that he preferred
to fight on the outside.</i>

29
00:01:24,384 --> 00:01:27,087
<i>But say you tie us up close?</i>

30
00:01:27,154 --> 00:01:28,622
"Yeah, I think I can do this."

31
00:01:28,689 --> 00:01:29,923
That's what I thought.

32
00:01:29,990 --> 00:01:31,191
I was terrified.

33
00:01:31,258 --> 00:01:33,393
I was like,
"If he hits me clean, I'm dead."

34
00:01:33,994 --> 00:01:38,131
<i>Still, his boxing experience isn't long.</i>

35
00:01:38,198 --> 00:01:40,901
<i>I figured I'd use the body combos
I've sharpened with my technique</i>

36
00:01:40,968 --> 00:01:43,337
<i>and really use my skills to the fullest</i>

37
00:01:43,837 --> 00:01:45,205
<i>to show what I'm made of.</i>

38
00:01:46,073 --> 00:01:48,775
{\an8}SAFELY CONDUCTED
WITH PROFESSIONAL MEDICAL STAFF ON SITE

39
00:01:50,143 --> 00:01:52,746
[Don] The Tire Brawl deathmatch...

40
00:01:54,748 --> 00:01:56,550
starts now.

41
00:01:58,685 --> 00:01:59,686
Box!

42
00:02:01,088 --> 00:02:02,089
- Let's go!
- Box!

43
00:02:05,959 --> 00:02:07,394
Okay, nice.

44
00:02:08,095 --> 00:02:09,396
Don't forget to breathe!

45
00:02:12,966 --> 00:02:15,369
- Oh, boy.
- Nice, that's it. Keep going.

46
00:02:24,077 --> 00:02:25,879
Yes! Drive that hook into the body!

47
00:02:25,946 --> 00:02:28,181
- He's aiming at the body.
- He's going to the body.

48
00:02:31,985 --> 00:02:33,453
Nice short shots!

49
00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:36,990
[Youngho] <i>He kept going to my body
in the earlier match too.</i>

50
00:02:37,524 --> 00:02:40,727
But I've never gone down
from taking a body shot.

51
00:02:41,328 --> 00:02:42,729
[Don] Seungjun, get your guard up!

52
00:02:43,764 --> 00:02:46,566
<i>Honestly,
I don't recall feeling any of it.</i>

53
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:47,834
[exclaims]

54
00:02:49,569 --> 00:02:50,604
[contestant 1] Get lower!

55
00:02:50,671 --> 00:02:52,072
- You're too high!
- [contestant 1] Hey, hey!

56
00:02:52,139 --> 00:02:53,340
Keep it short, man!

57
00:02:53,407 --> 00:02:55,008
- Guard up and breathe!
- Guard up!

58
00:02:55,075 --> 00:02:56,677
Park Youngho's durability is...

59
00:02:57,244 --> 00:02:58,645
Very nice.

60
00:02:58,712 --> 00:02:59,880
[Donghyun] He's about to gas.

61
00:02:59,946 --> 00:03:01,348
Just hang in there, Youngho.

62
00:03:04,451 --> 00:03:05,986
Yes, keep breathing. That's it.

63
00:03:10,957 --> 00:03:12,159
You've got more power!

64
00:03:12,826 --> 00:03:14,027
Guard up!

65
00:03:14,094 --> 00:03:15,862
Don't try to slip everything!
Guard up, man!

66
00:03:18,498 --> 00:03:19,666
Slip!

67
00:03:20,167 --> 00:03:21,601
- Slip!
- Okay, slip, slip.

68
00:03:21,668 --> 00:03:23,403
- His power is insane.
- Right.

69
00:03:23,470 --> 00:03:24,805
Like bam, bam, bam!

70
00:03:24,871 --> 00:03:26,673
He handled that great. Close call there.

71
00:03:27,741 --> 00:03:29,509
You're fine. Nice, that was great!

72
00:03:30,077 --> 00:03:31,578
Man, you're mad strong.

73
00:03:32,813 --> 00:03:35,282
He took control with his power.

74
00:03:35,348 --> 00:03:37,084
He kept firing combos,

75
00:03:37,150 --> 00:03:39,653
<i>and I struggled to put out anything clean.</i>

76
00:03:39,720 --> 00:03:40,721
Box!

77
00:03:44,891 --> 00:03:46,727
<i>So I had to rethink my approach.</i>

78
00:03:46,793 --> 00:03:49,496
You're stepping straight in, Seungjun!
Remember, two-step!

79
00:03:49,563 --> 00:03:50,897
Keep your guard high!

80
00:03:52,399 --> 00:03:53,834
Just try sticking it in!

81
00:03:53,900 --> 00:03:55,469
- Drive that body shot in!
- [contestant 2] Work!

82
00:03:57,738 --> 00:03:59,206
[Seungjun] <i>But even then,</i>

83
00:03:59,272 --> 00:04:02,375
<i>I put a lot more power
into the body shots.</i>

84
00:04:03,877 --> 00:04:06,146
He's starting to feel those body shots.

85
00:04:06,213 --> 00:04:07,748
[♪ intense music playing]

86
00:04:07,814 --> 00:04:09,583
[contestant 1] Pour it out!
Last one! That's it!

87
00:04:17,124 --> 00:04:18,391
[groans]

88
00:04:26,833 --> 00:04:28,769
- That's it!
- All right, all right, all right!

89
00:04:29,636 --> 00:04:31,571
- That's it!
- All right, all right, all right!

90
00:04:31,638 --> 00:04:33,573
- That's it!
- All right, all right, all right!

91
00:04:33,640 --> 00:04:35,275
Keep going! Connect the shots!

92
00:04:40,781 --> 00:04:42,349
It landed. Down, down, down!

93
00:04:45,152 --> 00:04:46,153
Down!

94
00:04:46,553 --> 00:04:47,554
Down.

95
00:04:48,054 --> 00:04:52,926
Three, four, five, six!

96
00:04:52,993 --> 00:04:55,495
- Oh, he got... Yeah.
- Yeah, down, down.

97
00:04:55,562 --> 00:04:57,531
- Liver shot.
- Yeah, liver shot.

98
00:04:57,597 --> 00:04:59,733
This is... good.

99
00:05:00,534 --> 00:05:05,071
Five, six, seven, eight!

100
00:05:06,406 --> 00:05:07,574
- Can you continue?
- Yeah.

101
00:05:08,108 --> 00:05:10,243
Okay, let's go again.

102
00:05:11,011 --> 00:05:13,580
Let's go, let's go! Let's go, you two.

103
00:05:13,647 --> 00:05:14,915
Focus, focus.

104
00:05:15,482 --> 00:05:16,483
Box!

105
00:05:28,195 --> 00:05:29,563
Go, go! Left to the body!

106
00:05:29,629 --> 00:05:31,631
Left to the body, man!

107
00:05:31,698 --> 00:05:33,500
[contestant 2] Keep going! Don't stop!

108
00:05:35,802 --> 00:05:37,337
[Seungjun] <i>Seeing him duck down like that,</i>

109
00:05:37,404 --> 00:05:38,872
<i>I just couldn't throw.</i>

110
00:05:38,939 --> 00:05:41,474
<i>As an active amateur fighter,</i>

111
00:05:41,541 --> 00:05:43,944
<i>I didn't want to keep hitting a hobbyist.</i>

112
00:05:44,010 --> 00:05:45,846
<i>I was waiting for the Master to call it.</i>

113
00:05:45,912 --> 00:05:48,181
Come on, what's the matter?

114
00:05:48,248 --> 00:05:49,516
Keep going!

115
00:05:49,583 --> 00:05:50,717
Keep going! Don't stop!

116
00:05:50,784 --> 00:05:52,452
Work, work, work, work!

117
00:05:52,519 --> 00:05:54,921
Seungjun, I get how you feel,
but you can't hold back!

118
00:05:54,988 --> 00:05:56,690
Seungjun, don't get soft!

119
00:05:57,557 --> 00:05:59,292
<i>I realized I had the wrong idea.</i>

120
00:06:00,527 --> 00:06:02,529
<i>Ending the fight quickly</i>

121
00:06:02,596 --> 00:06:05,899
<i>would actually be safer for him,</i>

122
00:06:05,966 --> 00:06:07,467
so I decided to push hard.

123
00:06:21,414 --> 00:06:23,283
There it is, there it is!

124
00:06:23,350 --> 00:06:25,886
Keep going! Don't stop!

125
00:06:25,952 --> 00:06:27,687
- There we go.
- All right!

126
00:06:29,556 --> 00:06:31,925
All right, let's stop here.

127
00:06:31,992 --> 00:06:33,226
- Stop!
- [bell dings]

128
00:06:34,694 --> 00:06:36,263
- Great job.
- Yeah, you too.

129
00:06:39,032 --> 00:06:40,567
- That was insane.
- Man, totally...

130
00:06:40,634 --> 00:06:41,801
Incredible.

131
00:06:41,868 --> 00:06:44,371
How do you even recover from that?
Well, damn...

132
00:06:44,938 --> 00:06:46,907
And even with the weight difference,

133
00:06:46,973 --> 00:06:48,875
Seungjun did very well.

134
00:06:48,942 --> 00:06:51,478
He really used every ounce
of strength he had.

135
00:06:51,544 --> 00:06:52,913
He gave it everything.

136
00:06:54,047 --> 00:06:55,815
<i>I honestly fought the best I could,</i>

137
00:06:55,882 --> 00:06:58,051
<i>and with a desperation like never before.</i>

138
00:06:58,118 --> 00:07:01,554
<i>Honestly, I poured everything out
with no regrets.</i>

139
00:07:02,122 --> 00:07:04,124
[Don] The survivor of this match is

140
00:07:05,358 --> 00:07:06,893
{\an8}Kuk Seungjun.

141
00:07:06,960 --> 00:07:08,662
{\an8}- Congratulations.
- [applause]

142
00:07:08,728 --> 00:07:09,863
{\an8}RED CORNER KUK SEUNGJUN SURVIVES

143
00:07:13,033 --> 00:07:14,034
[in English] Congratulations.

144
00:07:15,368 --> 00:07:17,971
Kuk Seungjun, it was good.

145
00:07:18,038 --> 00:07:20,573
I liked your body shots.

146
00:07:20,640 --> 00:07:25,578
It was the key to win this fight for you.

147
00:07:27,047 --> 00:07:33,386
And I can see
that Park Youngho is also a warrior,

148
00:07:33,887 --> 00:07:35,989
and he wanted to win.

149
00:07:36,589 --> 00:07:39,859
He was pushing. He was doing everything,

150
00:07:39,926 --> 00:07:43,063
but your skills, Kuk Seungjun,
were better.

151
00:07:44,297 --> 00:07:46,399
Yeah, congratulations to you.

152
00:07:49,202 --> 00:07:51,638
[in Korean] Let's run it back
once we're done filming. [laughs]

153
00:07:55,508 --> 00:07:57,010
I won.

154
00:07:58,478 --> 00:08:00,213
I'll set my sights higher

155
00:08:00,714 --> 00:08:03,249
and put on an even better fight next time.

156
00:08:03,817 --> 00:08:06,052
[Jongkook] All right,
back to the Tire Brawl deathmatch.

157
00:08:08,555 --> 00:08:10,623
The fighter to enter the deathmatch is...

158
00:08:11,925 --> 00:08:14,260
<i>I'm confident I can beat
whoever I'm matched with.</i>

159
00:08:14,327 --> 00:08:16,963
<i>Doesn't matter who it is,
I can take on anyone.</i>

160
00:08:18,431 --> 00:08:19,699
Shin Donghyun.

161
00:08:19,766 --> 00:08:22,035
{\an8}Shin Donghyun. Please step forward.

162
00:08:22,102 --> 00:08:23,570
{\an8}SHIN DONGHYUN
O*E CHAMPIONSHIP MUAY THAI FIGHTER

163
00:08:26,639 --> 00:08:29,809
The fighter facing Shin Donghyun is...

164
00:08:33,947 --> 00:08:35,482
Kim Hyunjun.

165
00:08:36,082 --> 00:08:37,550
{\an8}Kim Hyunjun.

166
00:08:37,617 --> 00:08:39,352
{\an8}- What?
- Please step forward.

167
00:08:39,419 --> 00:08:40,687
Muay Thai versus Muay Thai.

168
00:08:42,188 --> 00:08:43,556
Kim Hyunjun.

169
00:08:43,623 --> 00:08:44,624
[sighs]

170
00:08:49,763 --> 00:08:51,698
Both of them are Muay Thai fighters.

171
00:08:52,265 --> 00:08:54,667
{\an8}The two Muay Thai fighters,
carrying its pride.

172
00:08:54,734 --> 00:08:57,103
{\an8}You are now about to fight for survival.

173
00:08:58,772 --> 00:09:01,408
- I remember, they are both very strong.
- Yeah.

174
00:09:01,474 --> 00:09:02,509
Very powerful.

175
00:09:03,743 --> 00:09:06,046
<i>Man, Kim Hyunjun?</i>

176
00:09:06,112 --> 00:09:07,747
I wasn't too happy.

177
00:09:08,348 --> 00:09:12,519
<i>He's the only other
Muay Thai fighter remaining.</i>

178
00:09:12,585 --> 00:09:14,354
Oh, they're Muay Thai guys?

179
00:09:14,921 --> 00:09:16,723
Which gym are you from?

180
00:09:16,790 --> 00:09:19,793
I recently fought in O*E Championship.

181
00:09:19,859 --> 00:09:21,127
Muay Thai or kickboxing?

182
00:09:21,194 --> 00:09:23,663
- Muay Thai.
- Muay Thai? I see.

183
00:09:24,230 --> 00:09:26,633
During Hyunjun's fights,

184
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:30,770
<i>I worked his corner for him,
cheering so he'd do well.</i>

185
00:09:30,837 --> 00:09:33,173
Hyunjun, watch out after you land one.

186
00:09:33,239 --> 00:09:35,108
Hyunjun, make it tougher on him.

187
00:09:38,845 --> 00:09:40,013
Shin Donghyun, let's go!

188
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:43,149
<i>I cheered him on because I wanted to show</i>

189
00:09:43,216 --> 00:09:46,252
<i>that Muay Thai can absolutely beat boxing.</i>

190
00:09:46,319 --> 00:09:48,221
You're not hurt anywhere, right?

191
00:09:49,189 --> 00:09:52,092
Even so,
if only one of us gets to survive,

192
00:09:52,158 --> 00:09:55,028
I think it should be me.

193
00:09:55,095 --> 00:09:58,498
The time has finally come
for two Muay Thai fighters to face off.

194
00:09:59,632 --> 00:10:01,668
<i>Since this one's a Muay Thai matchup,</i>

195
00:10:02,235 --> 00:10:05,105
<i>I'm taking this with a clear win.</i>

196
00:10:05,638 --> 00:10:07,474
[Donghyun]
<i>I plan on finishing this quickly.</i>

197
00:10:07,540 --> 00:10:10,543
<i>Time to show him I'm the senior here.</i>

198
00:10:12,312 --> 00:10:15,181
{\an8}SAFELY CONDUCTED
WITH PROFESSIONAL MEDICAL STAFF ON SITE

199
00:10:15,248 --> 00:10:16,249
Let's go!

200
00:10:16,316 --> 00:10:17,584
Let's go, guys!

201
00:10:18,985 --> 00:10:20,687
Man, that's super close.

202
00:10:21,187 --> 00:10:22,922
<i>In my opinion, this one's all instinct.</i>

203
00:10:23,756 --> 00:10:25,892
The Tire Brawl deathmatch.

204
00:10:25,959 --> 00:10:27,327
Let the fight begin.

205
00:10:33,099 --> 00:10:34,667
- Box!
- [bell dings]

206
00:10:34,734 --> 00:10:35,602
- Let's go!
- Box!

207
00:10:35,668 --> 00:10:36,669
You got this!

208
00:10:46,079 --> 00:10:47,080
Oof!

209
00:10:48,281 --> 00:10:49,816
Whoa, he stuck that one in.

210
00:10:53,520 --> 00:10:55,989
[Donghyun] <i>I wanted to win by KO,</i>

211
00:10:56,055 --> 00:10:58,992
<i>so I opened aggressively.</i>

212
00:10:59,959 --> 00:11:02,328
- All right!
- Looks like he's switched it on.

213
00:11:09,536 --> 00:11:11,171
He needs to extend more.

214
00:11:11,237 --> 00:11:12,405
Keep it tight!

215
00:11:16,743 --> 00:11:17,777
All right!

216
00:11:21,114 --> 00:11:22,115
[exclaiming]

217
00:11:22,182 --> 00:11:23,416
Look at that power.

218
00:11:24,551 --> 00:11:28,021
<i>Since we were fighting close,
I kept a high guard...</i>

219
00:11:30,256 --> 00:11:32,358
<i>and went for strong, clean singles.</i>

220
00:11:32,425 --> 00:11:33,660
<i>That was the strategy.</i>

221
00:11:36,229 --> 00:11:37,797
He's doing this efficiently.

222
00:11:37,864 --> 00:11:39,632
Their strikes hit different.

223
00:11:44,671 --> 00:11:45,905
[Jongkook] He needs to cover up.

224
00:11:50,944 --> 00:11:52,478
- Oh, boy.
- Slip!

225
00:11:54,247 --> 00:11:55,648
- Oh, boy.
- Slip!

226
00:11:55,715 --> 00:11:57,817
Oh... Slip, slip, slip.

227
00:12:00,386 --> 00:12:02,422
<i>I was like, "Man, this isn't going well."</i>

228
00:12:02,488 --> 00:12:06,326
He was doing better than I thought,
landing those long shots.

229
00:12:06,392 --> 00:12:08,061
<i>I was a bit thrown off.</i>

230
00:12:09,329 --> 00:12:10,330
Box!

231
00:12:10,396 --> 00:12:11,965
- Let's go!
- Let's go, go!

232
00:12:12,031 --> 00:12:14,267
[♪ intense music playing]

233
00:12:14,834 --> 00:12:16,803
[Hyunjun] <i>As soon as
my opponent's attack ended,</i>

234
00:12:16,869 --> 00:12:18,671
<i>I threw a straight</i>

235
00:12:18,738 --> 00:12:20,206
to catch him with the counter.

236
00:12:33,553 --> 00:12:34,554
He's down.

237
00:12:38,324 --> 00:12:39,959
[Jongkook] So powerful.

238
00:12:40,693 --> 00:12:42,061
Okay, stop!

239
00:12:42,128 --> 00:12:43,129
Down!

240
00:12:43,830 --> 00:12:46,299
Three, four...

241
00:12:46,366 --> 00:12:47,567
[Jongkook] Yeah, that was a knockdown.

242
00:12:47,634 --> 00:12:49,369
He got hit and went down.

243
00:12:49,435 --> 00:12:52,538
Kim had a clever strategy.
He covered up, took what he had to,

244
00:12:52,605 --> 00:12:55,275
then went in for the scoring shots,
landing them clean.

245
00:12:55,341 --> 00:12:57,844
Seven, eight! Okay.

246
00:12:57,910 --> 00:12:59,245
Can you continue?

247
00:12:59,312 --> 00:13:00,580
- Yes.
- Okay.

248
00:13:01,581 --> 00:13:04,350
[Donghyun] <i>Once that knockdown happened,
my first thought was,</i>

249
00:13:04,417 --> 00:13:06,386
<i>"All right, one of us is going down."</i>

250
00:13:06,452 --> 00:13:07,687
<i>"Let's do this."</i>

251
00:13:08,921 --> 00:13:10,690
[Hyunjun] <i>I've got control of the pace.</i>

252
00:13:10,757 --> 00:13:12,358
<i>I'm definitely winning this.</i>

253
00:13:14,193 --> 00:13:15,194
Box!

254
00:13:18,364 --> 00:13:19,832
[contestant 3] All right, nice!

255
00:13:19,899 --> 00:13:21,301
Donghyun's no easy opponent.

256
00:13:21,367 --> 00:13:23,536
[♪ dramatic music playing]

257
00:13:23,603 --> 00:13:24,804
Go now! This is it!

258
00:13:28,941 --> 00:13:30,310
There's a clear power gap.

259
00:13:32,879 --> 00:13:33,913
He's strong.

260
00:13:48,761 --> 00:13:49,829
- Down.
- Down!

261
00:13:51,798 --> 00:13:52,865
- Down.
- Down!

262
00:13:52,932 --> 00:13:54,434
- Whoa, he's down.
- Down!

263
00:13:59,672 --> 00:14:00,673
Down!

264
00:14:02,675 --> 00:14:03,976
Stop, stop, stop.

265
00:14:04,043 --> 00:14:05,044
[bell dings]

266
00:14:05,111 --> 00:14:06,546
TKO, FIGHT OVER

267
00:14:07,647 --> 00:14:09,048
- You okay?
- Yeah.

268
00:14:10,616 --> 00:14:13,186
[Youngho] Man, that's a tough break.

269
00:14:15,321 --> 00:14:16,889
- You good?
- Yeah.

270
00:14:17,957 --> 00:14:20,426
He did well. He did really well.

271
00:14:21,260 --> 00:14:22,362
[in English] He's very good.

272
00:14:22,428 --> 00:14:24,197
Two knockdowns. Before that,

273
00:14:24,263 --> 00:14:27,266
- he also got in some hard punches.
- Right, right.

274
00:14:27,333 --> 00:14:31,270
[Jongkook, in Korean] In terms of striking
points, this side landed more, actually.

275
00:14:31,337 --> 00:14:33,005
- He threw more punches.
- Yeah.

276
00:14:33,072 --> 00:14:34,774
He did well, but...

277
00:14:36,409 --> 00:14:38,211
The survivor of this match,

278
00:14:39,278 --> 00:14:40,513
by KO victory,

279
00:14:40,580 --> 00:14:42,281
{\an8}is Kim Hyunjun.

280
00:14:42,348 --> 00:14:43,649
{\an8}BLUE CORNER KIM HYUNJUN SURVIVES

281
00:14:43,716 --> 00:14:44,751
{\an8}[applause]

282
00:14:44,817 --> 00:14:47,487
Well, boy... What an incredible fight.

283
00:14:48,121 --> 00:14:50,056
That was a fantastic showdown.

284
00:14:50,123 --> 00:14:54,026
First, I'd like to express my gratitude
to my senior and fellow fighter,

285
00:14:54,093 --> 00:14:58,865
Shin Donghyun,
for taking this fight with me.

286
00:14:58,931 --> 00:15:03,636
I'll do my best to show what I can bring.

287
00:15:07,774 --> 00:15:09,509
I feel relieved.

288
00:15:09,575 --> 00:15:12,412
I wish Kim Hyunjun nothing but the best

289
00:15:12,478 --> 00:15:15,148
from here on out. That's all.

290
00:15:17,049 --> 00:15:18,985
- Love that.
- Well said.

291
00:15:20,153 --> 00:15:21,454
- Good game.
- Likewise.

292
00:15:21,521 --> 00:15:23,189
- Well fought.
- Yes, you too.

293
00:15:24,424 --> 00:15:25,725
That was great.

294
00:15:25,792 --> 00:15:26,893
Good game, guys.

295
00:15:29,095 --> 00:15:31,230
This is the final match of the day

296
00:15:31,297 --> 00:15:33,199
for the last survival spot.

297
00:15:35,067 --> 00:15:36,135
Yuk Junseo.

298
00:15:38,070 --> 00:15:40,973
The fighter facing him is

299
00:15:41,040 --> 00:15:42,308
Kim Minwoo.

300
00:15:48,648 --> 00:15:51,284
[Dex]
Skill-wise, Kim Minwoo is definitely...

301
00:15:51,350 --> 00:15:53,953
- [Jongkook] Yeah, skill-wise.
- ...at a higher level, of course.

302
00:15:54,454 --> 00:15:58,090
But Yuk Junseo's skills have
come a long way since the start.

303
00:15:58,157 --> 00:15:59,592
He's improved a lot.

304
00:15:59,659 --> 00:16:00,960
In such a short time.

305
00:16:01,027 --> 00:16:03,062
[in English] Who do you think
will win this time?

306
00:16:03,129 --> 00:16:05,731
Oh, I don't know.
It's a very interesting fight.

307
00:16:05,798 --> 00:16:07,333
These two guys are so good.

308
00:16:07,400 --> 00:16:09,268
- They're both good.
- Yeah.

309
00:16:09,836 --> 00:16:12,705
[in Korean] But the people who've
fought Yuk Junseo

310
00:16:12,772 --> 00:16:15,308
say he's really strong.

311
00:16:15,875 --> 00:16:17,977
[Minwoo] <i>Junseo is way stronger
than you'd think.</i>

312
00:16:18,478 --> 00:16:19,946
It won't be easy.

313
00:16:20,713 --> 00:16:23,316
But since it's the last consolation match,

314
00:16:23,382 --> 00:16:25,051
I won't let this chance go to waste.

315
00:16:25,785 --> 00:16:28,688
<i>I'm taking this, no matter what.</i>

316
00:16:29,188 --> 00:16:32,525
<i>True to the name "Mad Dog,"
I'll tear into him like a real mad dog.</i>

317
00:16:33,559 --> 00:16:37,964
[Junseo] <i>At this point,
whether someone's a pro or not...</i>

318
00:16:38,030 --> 00:16:39,732
<i>None of it matters anymore.</i>

319
00:16:39,799 --> 00:16:41,634
<i>Now it's just fighter versus fighter.</i>

320
00:16:41,701 --> 00:16:44,403
<i>I'm going to see this through to the end.</i>

321
00:16:45,071 --> 00:16:47,073
[♪ exhilarating music playing]

322
00:16:48,140 --> 00:16:49,141
Let's go!

323
00:16:49,642 --> 00:16:50,810
- Let's go!
- Let's go!

324
00:16:52,078 --> 00:16:54,380
[Don] The Tire Brawl deathmatch.

325
00:16:55,114 --> 00:16:56,616
Let the fight begin.

326
00:16:58,084 --> 00:16:59,819
- Box!
- [bell dings]

327
00:16:59,886 --> 00:17:00,987
Box!

328
00:17:21,974 --> 00:17:23,342
[Jongkook] Cover up first!

329
00:17:24,877 --> 00:17:26,145
Don't grab, don't grab!

330
00:17:27,313 --> 00:17:28,714
Okay, break!

331
00:17:28,781 --> 00:17:29,849
No clinching.

332
00:17:29,916 --> 00:17:31,050
It's a literal brawl.

333
00:17:31,117 --> 00:17:32,451
A KO's coming for sure.

334
00:17:33,152 --> 00:17:35,021
- You have to punch.
- Use your fists.

335
00:17:38,558 --> 00:17:40,059
Go with short shots.

336
00:17:42,328 --> 00:17:46,299
[Minwoo] <i>The moment it started,
it just turned into a brawl.</i>

337
00:17:47,033 --> 00:17:49,302
[Junseo] <i>With our feet basically tied up,</i>

338
00:17:49,368 --> 00:17:52,004
<i>it didn't feel like a fight
you could really think through.</i>

339
00:17:52,071 --> 00:17:55,041
<i>You just had to crash in first.</i>

340
00:17:55,107 --> 00:17:56,242
- Break!
- Break, break.

341
00:17:56,309 --> 00:17:57,310
Okay, continue!

342
00:17:59,445 --> 00:18:00,780
That one landed clean just now.

343
00:18:04,951 --> 00:18:07,019
<i>I just decided to force my way in.</i>

344
00:18:12,258 --> 00:18:13,359
Okay, now push!

345
00:18:13,426 --> 00:18:15,895
- Push with your shoulder!
- Gotta cover up too!

346
00:18:15,962 --> 00:18:18,564
There you go. Cover, then go back in.

347
00:18:18,631 --> 00:18:19,799
Don't lock up his arms!

348
00:18:25,071 --> 00:18:26,839
- He's going for it.
- Nice, nice.

349
00:18:27,340 --> 00:18:29,542
Yuk Junseo's actually doing pretty well.

350
00:18:29,609 --> 00:18:30,843
He's better than I expected.

351
00:18:31,911 --> 00:18:33,112
Come on, cover up!

352
00:18:35,648 --> 00:18:37,383
[Jongkook] Short shots! That's it!

353
00:18:43,255 --> 00:18:45,558
Yes, there you go. Just like that.

354
00:18:47,593 --> 00:18:49,695
They're fighting like wild animals.

355
00:18:49,762 --> 00:18:53,399
- It's hard to tell who's better, yeah?
- Yeah.

356
00:18:55,001 --> 00:18:57,303
- Short shots!
- Keep it short and sweet!

357
00:18:58,938 --> 00:19:00,906
- Careful, watch the head!
- The head, the head!

358
00:19:00,973 --> 00:19:02,541
- Time!
- His head's going in too much.

359
00:19:03,442 --> 00:19:04,443
Oh, boy.

360
00:19:05,011 --> 00:19:06,879
He's leaning way too far forward.

361
00:19:06,946 --> 00:19:08,481
He needs to center his balance.

362
00:19:08,547 --> 00:19:10,383
Shouldn't dive his head in like that.

363
00:19:12,018 --> 00:19:14,854
Don't push in with your head.
You both need to fight with your fists.

364
00:19:15,421 --> 00:19:16,889
Okay, get ready!

365
00:19:16,956 --> 00:19:18,290
- Box!
- Come on, let's go!

366
00:19:18,357 --> 00:19:19,625
Let's go!

367
00:19:19,692 --> 00:19:20,760
Watch the head.

368
00:19:24,997 --> 00:19:27,333
Stay centered
and use your hands, both of you.

369
00:19:33,572 --> 00:19:34,607
Okay, stop!

370
00:19:34,674 --> 00:19:36,976
It's the distance.

371
00:19:37,043 --> 00:19:39,245
Some headbutting is unavoidable.

372
00:19:39,311 --> 00:19:42,682
- It's not like you can pull back either.
- Right.

373
00:19:45,885 --> 00:19:49,622
[Minwoo] <i>We kept butting heads,
and it was just mutual.</i>

374
00:19:50,156 --> 00:19:52,792
<i>We needed to push in deeper to land shots,</i>

375
00:19:52,858 --> 00:19:55,895
<i>so you couldn't call it anyone's fault.</i>

376
00:19:55,961 --> 00:19:57,997
<i>We both gave it everything we had.</i>

377
00:19:58,064 --> 00:20:00,366
All right, let's go!
Get ready to go again!

378
00:20:00,433 --> 00:20:01,834
- Come on, fight!
- Okay, go.

379
00:20:01,901 --> 00:20:02,902
Box!

380
00:20:02,968 --> 00:20:04,437
[♪ dramatic music playing]

381
00:20:04,503 --> 00:20:05,671
Watch the head. Last warning.

382
00:20:05,738 --> 00:20:07,206
Come on, almost done!

383
00:20:07,740 --> 00:20:08,841
Let's go!

384
00:20:10,209 --> 00:20:12,845
- Hey, don't crash heads!
- Watch the head.

385
00:20:12,912 --> 00:20:15,047
[Minwoo] <i>I'll pour everything out
to the end.</i>

386
00:20:15,114 --> 00:20:18,217
[Junseo] <i>Let's see who's
still standing at the end.</i>

387
00:20:26,092 --> 00:20:27,359
He's strong, all right.

388
00:20:27,426 --> 00:20:28,894
Come on, last push! That's it!

389
00:20:29,462 --> 00:20:31,464
They're running the tank dry.

390
00:20:32,064 --> 00:20:33,599
- That one got in.
- Come on!

391
00:20:33,666 --> 00:20:35,201
Let's go! Not much left!

392
00:20:39,105 --> 00:20:40,172
Let's go!

393
00:20:43,075 --> 00:20:44,210
[bell dings]

394
00:20:44,276 --> 00:20:45,344
Stop!

395
00:20:51,150 --> 00:20:53,185
[Youngho] That was
a total bloodbath, seriously.

396
00:20:53,786 --> 00:20:57,490
They both have a warrior's heart.
Neither of them would back down.

397
00:20:57,556 --> 00:20:58,858
[contestant] They've done
all the cool stuff.

398
00:20:59,525 --> 00:21:00,960
No idea who takes this.

399
00:21:01,560 --> 00:21:03,562
What do we even base this on?

400
00:21:03,629 --> 00:21:06,398
[in English] I cannot... I cannot decide.

401
00:21:07,199 --> 00:21:08,334
One guy is MMA.

402
00:21:08,400 --> 00:21:11,403
And then one guy...
He trained only one year, so...

403
00:21:11,470 --> 00:21:14,840
- Yeah, but the MMA should be better.
- Yeah.

404
00:21:14,907 --> 00:21:19,912
- But that guy is very... very strong.
- Yeah.

405
00:21:20,913 --> 00:21:24,650
[in Korean] From that close,
they were both firing nonstop,

406
00:21:24,717 --> 00:21:26,919
so it's hard to say
one did better than the other.

407
00:21:26,986 --> 00:21:29,021
The judging criteria
will be crucial for this one.

408
00:21:30,890 --> 00:21:32,391
We'll announce the result.

409
00:21:33,826 --> 00:21:37,530
<i>I felt like I'd emptied the tank
and given it absolutely everything.</i>

410
00:21:38,464 --> 00:21:40,966
<i>I'm going to win and move up.</i>

411
00:21:42,935 --> 00:21:46,539
<i>Hearing that three of us
would get back in the game</i>

412
00:21:46,605 --> 00:21:48,374
<i>really fired me up.</i>

413
00:21:48,440 --> 00:21:50,409
<i>Quarterfinals, here I come.</i>

414
00:21:50,476 --> 00:21:52,478
The survivor of this match is...

415
00:21:56,515 --> 00:21:57,683
{\an8}Yuk Junseo.

416
00:21:57,750 --> 00:21:59,819
{\an8}RED CORNER YUK JUNSEO SURVIVES

417
00:22:02,588 --> 00:22:03,989
Congratulations.

418
00:22:04,056 --> 00:22:06,692
That was an incredible fight
from both athletes.

419
00:22:06,759 --> 00:22:08,260
[in English] Congratulations.

420
00:22:08,828 --> 00:22:11,330
Both of you were good.

421
00:22:11,397 --> 00:22:16,135
It was very hard for all of us
to choose who's better.

422
00:22:16,936 --> 00:22:19,572
But it was a very equal fight.

423
00:22:20,072 --> 00:22:24,376
It shows that he's very similar.
They were equal levels.

424
00:22:24,443 --> 00:22:30,382
But I know you're practicing
only one year in boxing.

425
00:22:30,449 --> 00:22:33,319
And your opponent is
practicing seven years.

426
00:22:33,819 --> 00:22:36,055
He has advantage for this,

427
00:22:36,121 --> 00:22:38,390
but you were very equal in this.

428
00:22:38,457 --> 00:22:42,928
I think it will be fair
for you to take this win.

429
00:22:42,995 --> 00:22:44,663
[applause]

430
00:22:44,730 --> 00:22:46,699
[in Korean] Let's hear from
our last survivor, Yuk Junseo.

431
00:22:46,765 --> 00:22:48,400
How do you feel?

432
00:22:48,467 --> 00:22:51,070
I want to thank Kim Minwoo once again

433
00:22:51,136 --> 00:22:53,472
for stepping into this match with me.

434
00:22:53,539 --> 00:22:56,775
Since I've earned this win,

435
00:22:56,842 --> 00:22:59,178
I'll remember today's fight

436
00:22:59,979 --> 00:23:04,083
and give everything I have
to move up to the finals. Thank you.

437
00:23:07,086 --> 00:23:09,321
It's tough, but I accept the loss.

438
00:23:09,388 --> 00:23:11,657
Junseo, since you beat me,

439
00:23:11,724 --> 00:23:14,793
I really hope you go higher

440
00:23:14,860 --> 00:23:17,396
and take the championship. Thank you.

441
00:23:19,598 --> 00:23:21,033
You both did amazing.

442
00:23:21,533 --> 00:23:25,137
It feels like the end
is right within reach.

443
00:23:25,204 --> 00:23:27,873
<i>The fact that I'm still a part of this</i>

444
00:23:28,440 --> 00:23:29,742
<i>is truly an honor.</i>

445
00:23:29,808 --> 00:23:32,745
<i>I want to show that I can be</i>

446
00:23:32,811 --> 00:23:34,613
<i>one hell of a boxer too.</i>

447
00:23:35,147 --> 00:23:36,482
That wraps up all the matches.

448
00:23:36,548 --> 00:23:37,416
[♪ uplifting music playing]

449
00:23:37,483 --> 00:23:40,920
Congratulations to the three fighters
who survived the deathmatch.

450
00:23:41,487 --> 00:23:42,521
{\an8}Yuk Junseo,

451
00:23:42,588 --> 00:23:43,822
{\an8}Kim Hyunjun,

452
00:23:43,889 --> 00:23:45,491
{\an8}and Kuk Seungjun.

453
00:23:45,557 --> 00:23:46,725
Congratulations.

454
00:23:46,792 --> 00:23:48,594
- Congratulations.
- Congratulations.

455
00:23:50,462 --> 00:23:52,564
I didn't expect to make it this far.

456
00:23:52,631 --> 00:23:56,468
[Junseo] <i>Just making it from 90 fighters
down to single digits</i>

457
00:23:57,136 --> 00:23:58,504
<i>is an honor.</i>

458
00:23:59,071 --> 00:24:01,440
[in English] Thank you, guys. All of you.

459
00:24:01,507 --> 00:24:04,610
For making this great event for us.

460
00:24:10,950 --> 00:24:15,254
I'm happy to come to Korea
to see this show.

461
00:24:15,321 --> 00:24:18,457
It was very impressive.
It was very incredible fights.

462
00:24:21,026 --> 00:24:24,830
And I hope we will see you in the future.

463
00:24:24,897 --> 00:24:27,166
On the world stage.

464
00:24:28,200 --> 00:24:31,870
[Minwoo] <i>If I could get another chance,
I'd fight 100 times, 1,000 times again.</i>

465
00:24:31,937 --> 00:24:33,639
[Youngho] <i>We all gave it
everything we had.</i>

466
00:24:33,706 --> 00:24:37,710
That alone makes me feel like
I fought well

467
00:24:37,776 --> 00:24:39,211
and can walk away proud.

468
00:24:39,278 --> 00:24:42,281
I feel like
I really left it all out there.

469
00:24:42,982 --> 00:24:44,583
I just want to go home now.

470
00:24:45,384 --> 00:24:46,518
I'm exhausted.

471
00:24:47,386 --> 00:24:48,387
[chuckles]

472
00:24:49,722 --> 00:24:51,724
[♪ classical music playing]

473
00:24:56,462 --> 00:24:59,732
[Jongkook] It's my first time coming here,
but this place is incredible.

474
00:25:00,265 --> 00:25:02,735
- Our fighters have been through hell.
- Right.

475
00:25:02,801 --> 00:25:06,605
So I thought we'd prepare
a glamorous treat for them,

476
00:25:06,672 --> 00:25:08,640
- as a reward.
- Wait, what's that?

477
00:25:08,707 --> 00:25:10,743
- [♪ rock music playing]
- Wait, what's that?

478
00:25:10,809 --> 00:25:12,144
Wow, look at that.

479
00:25:12,211 --> 00:25:13,846
Look, they're all in a tuxedo!

480
00:25:14,346 --> 00:25:15,781
Wow, looking good.

481
00:25:16,415 --> 00:25:18,117
- Hello, sir.
- Hello, sir.

482
00:25:20,152 --> 00:25:21,687
[Sungmin sings] <i>♪ She is the one... ♪</i>

483
00:25:21,754 --> 00:25:22,755
No, don't start.

484
00:25:23,455 --> 00:25:25,657
- Take a seat.
- They look great in a tux.

485
00:25:25,724 --> 00:25:26,925
I know, right?

486
00:25:26,992 --> 00:25:28,360
Feels awkward, though.

487
00:25:29,361 --> 00:25:30,996
- All right.
- Wait, hold on.

488
00:25:31,063 --> 00:25:32,765
Over here, you can...

489
00:25:32,831 --> 00:25:33,999
- You hate me, man?
- No, no.

490
00:25:34,066 --> 00:25:35,167
You can sit over here.

491
00:25:38,003 --> 00:25:40,172
We have three empty seats.

492
00:25:40,239 --> 00:25:42,908
Didn't those three empty seats
make you wonder?

493
00:25:42,975 --> 00:25:44,076
Maybe they're hiding.

494
00:25:44,143 --> 00:25:46,645
Any guesses on who survived?

495
00:25:46,712 --> 00:25:50,215
- I just hope it's not those two.
- [all laughing]

496
00:25:50,282 --> 00:25:52,551
I'm praying they don't show up.

497
00:25:52,618 --> 00:25:54,253
Same here.

498
00:25:54,319 --> 00:25:55,654
- Oh, <i>the</i> ultimate two?
- Yeah.

499
00:25:57,890 --> 00:25:58,957
[all exclaiming]

500
00:26:02,828 --> 00:26:04,663
Hello there. Nice to see you again.

501
00:26:04,730 --> 00:26:06,865
Here's our survivors from hell.

502
00:26:06,932 --> 00:26:08,534
Yuk Junseo, back from hell.

503
00:26:09,101 --> 00:26:10,202
What a handsome bunch!

504
00:26:10,269 --> 00:26:11,403
Congratulations.

505
00:26:11,470 --> 00:26:14,506
Yesterday's deathmatch was indeed brutal.

506
00:26:14,573 --> 00:26:16,075
With a number of injuries too.

507
00:26:16,141 --> 00:26:18,143
- Is your eye okay?
- Yes, it's fine now.

508
00:26:18,210 --> 00:26:19,378
The swelling's gone down.

509
00:26:19,445 --> 00:26:21,814
- You, Junseo?
- That bruise faded quickly.

510
00:26:21,880 --> 00:26:23,015
Right, it's almost gone.

511
00:26:23,082 --> 00:26:24,483
Didn't cover it up, did you?

512
00:26:24,550 --> 00:26:26,118
Maybe just a little.

513
00:26:26,185 --> 00:26:28,287
Junseo seems to recover really fast.

514
00:26:28,353 --> 00:26:29,655
Yeah, I heal fast.

515
00:26:29,721 --> 00:26:31,957
And Kuk Seungjun, dapper.

516
00:26:32,024 --> 00:26:35,127
Now it's only the real heavy-hitters left.

517
00:26:35,194 --> 00:26:37,262
I heard each of you

518
00:26:37,329 --> 00:26:39,231
picked a ring name.

519
00:26:39,298 --> 00:26:41,633
Shall we go around and hear them out?

520
00:26:42,134 --> 00:26:43,635
{\an8}BODY KILLER

521
00:26:44,136 --> 00:26:45,637
{\an8}BLAZE

522
00:26:45,704 --> 00:26:47,806
{\an8}SHOTGUN, TYSON

523
00:26:47,873 --> 00:26:49,975
{\an8}STRIKER, THUNDER

524
00:26:50,042 --> 00:26:51,977
{\an8}PRETTY BOY, PRINCE

525
00:26:52,044 --> 00:26:55,614
Hearing all these ring names,
it's really sinking in now.

526
00:26:56,115 --> 00:26:57,783
Do you have a ring name?

527
00:26:57,850 --> 00:26:59,051
No, I don't.

528
00:26:59,118 --> 00:27:02,020
- Everyone just calls me "Mavely."
- [all laugh]

529
00:27:02,087 --> 00:27:04,523
Do you like it? "Mavely"?

530
00:27:04,590 --> 00:27:06,191
Of course. I love it.

531
00:27:06,825 --> 00:27:08,527
- What's this?
- Man, what's this?

532
00:27:08,594 --> 00:27:10,863
- [♪ upbeat jazz music playing]
- Looks delicious.

533
00:27:10,929 --> 00:27:12,331
Amazing!

534
00:27:12,397 --> 00:27:13,599
- Looks tasty.
- That's insane.

535
00:27:13,665 --> 00:27:14,800
It's Korean pork.

536
00:27:14,867 --> 00:27:16,602
Pork's rich in protein,

537
00:27:16,668 --> 00:27:18,370
and helps with post-workout recovery.

538
00:27:18,437 --> 00:27:20,139
I hope you all enjoy it.

539
00:27:20,205 --> 00:27:23,642
Personally, I prefer pork over beef.

540
00:27:23,709 --> 00:27:25,844
- Pork tastes better, to be honest.
- It does.

541
00:27:25,911 --> 00:27:28,547
Pork fat, what we call lard...

542
00:27:28,614 --> 00:27:30,315
People say it's not good for you,

543
00:27:30,382 --> 00:27:31,583
but that's all old talk.

544
00:27:31,650 --> 00:27:33,051
Hope you enjoy.

545
00:27:33,118 --> 00:27:35,988
It's not like you need to cut weight now,
so go ahead and eat.

546
00:27:36,054 --> 00:27:37,356
- [all laugh]
- Let's eat.

547
00:27:37,422 --> 00:27:38,524
- Enjoy.
- Enjoy.

548
00:27:38,590 --> 00:27:40,325
- Enjoy.
- Thank you for the food. Enjoy.

549
00:27:40,392 --> 00:27:42,127
- This must be the pork.
- Mmm.

550
00:27:45,497 --> 00:27:46,532
It's super good.

551
00:27:47,099 --> 00:27:48,400
Can I take the leftovers home?

552
00:27:48,467 --> 00:27:50,669
The meat is ridiculously tender.

553
00:27:50,736 --> 00:27:53,038
Isn't this exactly
what you need for your training?

554
00:27:53,105 --> 00:27:54,239
Yeah, for sure.

555
00:27:54,306 --> 00:27:56,475
Korean pork, man.

556
00:27:57,042 --> 00:27:59,011
{\an8}Is there a match
that stuck with you the most?

557
00:27:59,077 --> 00:28:01,680
Well, I mean...
Like one that's burned into your mind?

558
00:28:02,514 --> 00:28:04,917
- The Three-Man Battle was super tough.
- Really?

559
00:28:04,983 --> 00:28:06,285
The Three-Man Battle, huh?

560
00:28:06,351 --> 00:28:08,987
Master Lee pressed the button
way too late.

561
00:28:09,054 --> 00:28:10,389
Did I?

562
00:28:10,455 --> 00:28:13,225
Was there a set time to press it?

563
00:28:13,292 --> 00:28:16,628
I mean, I kept thinking,
"Wait, why isn't he pressing it?"

564
00:28:16,695 --> 00:28:18,697
No wonder he kept glancing over at me.

565
00:28:20,365 --> 00:28:23,602
- Like, "What's taking him so long?"
- "It's about time, isn't it?"

566
00:28:23,669 --> 00:28:25,370
That's why I looked away.

567
00:28:28,273 --> 00:28:31,176
Well, let's get down
to business now, shall we?

568
00:28:31,843 --> 00:28:33,745
The eight of you here

569
00:28:33,812 --> 00:28:37,282
will battle it out head-to-head
once again in the next round.

570
00:28:38,116 --> 00:28:39,151
We are

571
00:28:40,185 --> 00:28:42,054
- revealing it right here, right now.
- [all gasp, exclaim]

572
00:28:43,989 --> 00:28:44,990
All right.

573
00:28:46,058 --> 00:28:48,460
Hope this doesn't upset your stomach.

574
00:28:49,228 --> 00:28:51,430
Out of the original 90 fighters,

575
00:28:51,997 --> 00:28:54,900
only eight remain.

576
00:28:55,601 --> 00:28:56,735
The quarterfinals

577
00:28:57,536 --> 00:29:00,305
will be a formal one-on-one boxing match

578
00:29:00,872 --> 00:29:02,007
with six rounds,

579
00:29:02,474 --> 00:29:04,743
each lasting three minutes.

580
00:29:04,810 --> 00:29:06,211
[♪ tense music playing]

581
00:29:08,046 --> 00:29:09,114
Six rounds.

582
00:29:10,115 --> 00:29:11,250
I've never done that before.

583
00:29:12,818 --> 00:29:13,885
I'm dead.

584
00:29:14,953 --> 00:29:16,588
- This is intense.
- It's all stamina.

585
00:29:19,391 --> 00:29:21,326
[chuckling] <i>Why hit us with this
on such a good day?</i>

586
00:29:22,127 --> 00:29:24,863
<i>We literally just finished
a nice meal together.</i>

587
00:29:25,430 --> 00:29:28,333
<i>I suddenly felt like I couldn't breathe.</i>

588
00:29:29,701 --> 00:29:34,473
All right then,
in Master Don Lee's hands lies

589
00:29:34,539 --> 00:29:36,275
the quarterfinals matchup list.

590
00:29:40,145 --> 00:29:41,713
Let's reveal the matchups

591
00:29:42,614 --> 00:29:43,682
right now.

592
00:29:44,516 --> 00:29:47,352
When your name is called,
please step forward.

593
00:29:49,788 --> 00:29:51,990
The quarterfinals, bout number one.

594
00:29:53,292 --> 00:29:54,293
In the blue corner...

595
00:29:56,295 --> 00:29:58,397
Body Killer, Kuk Seungjun.

596
00:29:58,897 --> 00:30:01,266
Body Killer, Kuk Seungjun.

597
00:30:05,671 --> 00:30:06,738
In the red corner...

598
00:30:12,144 --> 00:30:14,112
Shotgun, Kim Hyunjun.

599
00:30:18,150 --> 00:30:19,651
Someone's gonna get dropped.

600
00:30:20,886 --> 00:30:23,221
[Gijun] <i>These two never back down.</i>

601
00:30:23,288 --> 00:30:24,956
<i>This one's gonna be fun.</i>

602
00:30:25,657 --> 00:30:27,592
A good-looking pair.

603
00:30:27,659 --> 00:30:30,462
{\an8}Kuk Seungjun from the blue corner,

604
00:30:30,529 --> 00:30:32,764
{\an8}do you have any words for your opponent?

605
00:30:33,532 --> 00:30:37,936
I haven't been happy
with any of my performances so far.

606
00:30:38,003 --> 00:30:40,572
This time, I'll leave nothing behind.

607
00:30:41,306 --> 00:30:44,276
As the last man standing
from another discipline,

608
00:30:44,343 --> 00:30:46,278
I'll make sure to prove myself.

609
00:30:48,046 --> 00:30:50,215
<i>It's gonna be a wild back-and-forth.</i>

610
00:30:50,716 --> 00:30:51,817
Who will win?

611
00:30:58,323 --> 00:31:01,259
{\an8}KUK SEUNGJUN, BODY KILLER
KIM HYUNJUN, SHOTGUN

612
00:31:01,326 --> 00:31:03,228
[Lee] The quarterfinals, bout number two.

613
00:31:03,995 --> 00:31:05,230
[sighs]

614
00:31:05,297 --> 00:31:06,498
I'm nervous.

615
00:31:07,265 --> 00:31:08,500
[Lee] In the blue corner...

616
00:31:09,067 --> 00:31:11,002
Pretty Boy, Cho Hyunjae.

617
00:31:11,370 --> 00:31:13,672
{\an8}PRETTY BOY
CHO HYUNJAE, 177 CM/65 KG

618
00:31:13,739 --> 00:31:17,275
[Hyunjae] <i>Hearing it was six rounds
was a bit daunting,</i>

619
00:31:17,342 --> 00:31:19,077
<i>but I just wanted to do it already.</i>

620
00:31:19,144 --> 00:31:21,346
<i>I couldn't wait for them
to announce my opponent.</i>

621
00:31:22,814 --> 00:31:24,249
[Lee] In the red corner...

622
00:31:24,916 --> 00:31:26,818
Blaze, Yuk Junseo.

623
00:31:26,885 --> 00:31:28,019
{\an8}...Yuk Junseo.

624
00:31:28,086 --> 00:31:29,788
{\an8}BLAZE
YUK JUNSEO, 176 CM/67 KG

625
00:31:29,855 --> 00:31:31,289
[Jongkook] These two have fought before,

626
00:31:31,356 --> 00:31:32,724
though it was three-way.

627
00:31:34,893 --> 00:31:36,661
Yes, that went in clean.

628
00:31:36,728 --> 00:31:38,363
[contestant] He's doubling over.

629
00:31:38,430 --> 00:31:41,566
[Lee] The survivor of this match is
Cho Hyunjae from the white corner.

630
00:31:43,802 --> 00:31:47,239
I'll make it undeniable
that I'm better this time.

631
00:31:48,173 --> 00:31:49,975
He's a really tough opponent,

632
00:31:50,776 --> 00:31:52,344
but losing's not an option for me.

633
00:31:52,844 --> 00:31:54,179
I'll bring the heat.

634
00:31:54,246 --> 00:31:55,247
Whoa.

635
00:31:59,651 --> 00:32:02,721
{\an8}CHO HYUNJAE, PRETTY BOY
YUK JUNSEO, BLAZE

636
00:32:02,788 --> 00:32:04,856
The quarterfinals, third bout.

637
00:32:06,291 --> 00:32:08,093
Striker, Lee Gijun.

638
00:32:09,261 --> 00:32:13,265
{\an8}STRIKER
LEE GIJUN, 174 CM/70 KG

639
00:32:13,331 --> 00:32:14,433
In the red corner...

640
00:32:15,133 --> 00:32:17,102
{\an8}Prince, Lee Chaehyun.

641
00:32:17,169 --> 00:32:18,236
{\an8}PRINCE
LEE CHAEHYUN, 179 CM/71 KG

642
00:32:18,737 --> 00:32:21,239
{\an8}LEE GIJUN VS LEE CHAEHYUN

643
00:32:21,306 --> 00:32:23,442
[Chaehyun] <i>He's not too bad
as an opponent.</i>

644
00:32:23,508 --> 00:32:24,643
<i>I can take him.</i>

645
00:32:25,410 --> 00:32:27,746
[Gijun] <i>Strength-wise,
I'm definitely not behind.</i>

646
00:32:27,813 --> 00:32:29,314
<i>But I've got the better gas tank.</i>

647
00:32:30,215 --> 00:32:31,650
All right.

648
00:32:32,484 --> 00:32:35,654
{\an8}LEE GIJUN, STRIKER
LEE CHAEHYUN, PRINCE

649
00:32:35,720 --> 00:32:37,389
[Lee] The quarterfinals, fourth bout!

650
00:32:38,857 --> 00:32:40,292
{\an8}Tyson, Hong Sungmin.

651
00:32:41,026 --> 00:32:42,427
{\an8}Thunder, Kwon Ohgon.

652
00:32:42,494 --> 00:32:43,829
{\an8}HONG SUNGMIN VS KWON OHGON

653
00:32:44,296 --> 00:32:47,732
Now that I'm fighting Hong Sungmin,

654
00:32:47,799 --> 00:32:50,101
the strongest of the remaining fighters,

655
00:32:50,168 --> 00:32:51,636
I'll finish this with a bang

656
00:32:51,703 --> 00:32:53,371
and move up.

657
00:32:56,308 --> 00:32:59,077
Ohgon's got a family to go home to,

658
00:32:59,578 --> 00:33:01,279
so I'll at least spare his life.

659
00:33:01,346 --> 00:33:02,447
[chuckles]

660
00:33:08,553 --> 00:33:11,590
{\an8}HONG SUNGMIN, TYSON
KWON OHGON, THUNDER

661
00:33:11,656 --> 00:33:13,358
[Lee] At last, it's the quarterfinals.

662
00:33:13,758 --> 00:33:16,995
Prepare yourselves
to leave everything out there

663
00:33:17,062 --> 00:33:18,430
with no regrets.

664
00:33:18,497 --> 00:33:21,132
[Jongkook] I'll be looking forward
to a legendary set of matches!

665
00:33:43,488 --> 00:33:45,557
- Box!
- [bell dings]

666
00:33:45,624 --> 00:33:46,858
[Seungheon] Nice shot!

667
00:33:46,925 --> 00:33:48,226
Right hook!

668
00:33:48,860 --> 00:33:50,562
Huge left hand!

669
00:33:51,830 --> 00:33:53,031
He's not stopping just yet!

670
00:33:54,666 --> 00:33:56,401
Oh, wow! That was close!

671
00:33:57,836 --> 00:33:59,604
- Here he comes!
- [spectators cheering]

672
00:34:00,505 --> 00:34:03,542
- [Gyuwon] He's looking to finish this!
- [spectator 1] He's throwing full swings!

673
00:34:03,608 --> 00:34:04,776
[spectator 2] You got this!

674
00:34:04,843 --> 00:34:06,645
- [crowd clamors]
- [applause]

675
00:34:12,183 --> 00:34:15,186
EPISODE 7
Hard Eight

676
00:34:15,253 --> 00:34:16,254
I AM BOXER

677
00:34:19,357 --> 00:34:21,359
[applause]

678
00:34:22,294 --> 00:34:24,963
[announcer] <i>The blockbuster
boxing survival show.</i>

679
00:34:25,564 --> 00:34:26,865
I Am Boxer.

680
00:34:29,868 --> 00:34:32,203
<i>Introducing our hosts!</i>

681
00:35:03,735 --> 00:35:05,437
{\an8}DON LEE, KBF CERTIFIED COACH,
KBA CERTIFIED RINGSIDE JUDGE

682
00:35:11,376 --> 00:35:12,677
[Lee] Hello, everyone.

683
00:35:13,244 --> 00:35:15,180
Your local boxing gym owner,

684
00:35:15,246 --> 00:35:17,816
and the Master of <i>I Am Boxer</i>.

685
00:35:20,785 --> 00:35:23,788
<i>I Am Boxer</i> started with 90 fighters.

686
00:35:23,855 --> 00:35:28,760
And tonight,
only eight will step into the ring.

687
00:35:28,827 --> 00:35:31,329
You're in for an incredible night.

688
00:35:31,963 --> 00:35:35,066
Tonight, we kick things off
with the quarterfinals.

689
00:35:35,133 --> 00:35:38,069
Each bout consists
of six three-minute rounds.

690
00:35:39,304 --> 00:35:40,472
Six three-minute rounds?

691
00:35:40,538 --> 00:35:43,308
Among the eight fighters
competing tonight,

692
00:35:43,375 --> 00:35:46,811
one will become
the ultimate <i>I Am Boxer</i> champion.

693
00:35:47,379 --> 00:35:50,382
The winner will receive a champion belt...

694
00:35:51,416 --> 00:35:52,584
Yes, there it is.

695
00:35:53,385 --> 00:35:55,520
And a top-of-the-line flagship SUV.

696
00:35:55,587 --> 00:35:57,689
[spectators gasp]

697
00:36:00,158 --> 00:36:03,795
I hear the fighters' parents
were thrilled.

698
00:36:03,862 --> 00:36:04,863
[Lee] Yes, of course.

699
00:36:04,929 --> 00:36:06,297
[Jongkook] And finally,

700
00:36:06,765 --> 00:36:08,199
a grand prize.

701
00:36:09,034 --> 00:36:10,335
A grand prize of...

702
00:36:10,902 --> 00:36:12,771
three hundred million won!

703
00:36:12,837 --> 00:36:14,773
...three hundred million won!

704
00:36:18,076 --> 00:36:19,344
[Jongkook] As expected,

705
00:36:19,411 --> 00:36:22,714
the crowd is really reacting to that.

706
00:36:23,214 --> 00:36:25,483
Hearing that makes even me think

707
00:36:25,550 --> 00:36:28,353
if there's a next season,
maybe I should apply.

708
00:36:28,420 --> 00:36:29,821
[Jongkook] Yes, sure.

709
00:36:29,888 --> 00:36:31,556
All right then, welcome to <i>I Am Boxer.</i>

710
00:36:32,490 --> 00:36:35,026
Let's get this show on the road.

711
00:36:35,093 --> 00:36:37,095
- [applause]
- [spectators cheering]

712
00:36:40,131 --> 00:36:42,701
{\an8}Hello, viewers.
Welcome to the <i>I Am Boxer</i> Quarterfinals.

713
00:36:42,767 --> 00:36:45,837
{\an8}I'm sportscaster Seong Seungheon,
joined by commentator Lee Gyuwon.

714
00:36:45,904 --> 00:36:49,140
[Gyuwon] Tonight's stage is
more than just a fight.

715
00:36:49,207 --> 00:36:53,044
It's about showing the world
how far Korean boxing has come.

716
00:36:53,111 --> 00:36:55,013
This is a match that demands more focus

717
00:36:55,080 --> 00:36:57,449
and stronger conviction than any before.

718
00:36:58,783 --> 00:37:00,585
The quarterfinals of <i>I Am Boxer.</i>

719
00:37:00,652 --> 00:37:02,921
Let the first bout begin.

720
00:37:02,987 --> 00:37:05,323
- [applause]
- [spectators cheering]

721
00:37:08,393 --> 00:37:13,932
Entering from the blue corner,
Body Killer, Kuk Seungjun!

722
00:37:20,171 --> 00:37:22,974
{\an8}KUK SEUNJUN'S PARENTS

723
00:37:23,041 --> 00:37:24,309
I AM BOXER

724
00:37:36,621 --> 00:37:38,189
[spectator 1] Looking sharp!

725
00:37:45,130 --> 00:37:47,031
[spectator 2] Man, he could
easily pass for a celebrity.

726
00:37:48,767 --> 00:37:50,235
[spectator 3] What a stud!

727
00:37:54,439 --> 00:37:56,207
[spectator 4] He's a total prince.

728
00:38:01,246 --> 00:38:03,615
[Jongkook] And the fighter facing
Kuk Seungjun...

729
00:38:04,082 --> 00:38:07,018
Please welcome Shotgun, Kim Hyunjun!

730
00:38:08,186 --> 00:38:10,188
- [applause]
- [spectators cheering]

731
00:38:28,807 --> 00:38:31,142
[Dex] Well, he's definitely got some fire.

732
00:38:31,776 --> 00:38:33,545
[Jongkook] Nice, he's got good energy.

733
00:38:36,648 --> 00:38:37,849
{\an8}You got this!

734
00:38:37,916 --> 00:38:39,684
{\an8}KIM HYUNJUN'S MOTHER

735
00:38:42,687 --> 00:38:43,688
[spectator 1 exclaims]

736
00:38:46,324 --> 00:38:47,725
This one's gonna be good.

737
00:38:47,792 --> 00:38:50,461
- I really don't know how this one will go.
- [Jongkook] Really, no idea.

738
00:38:51,896 --> 00:38:53,097
[announcer] <i>From the blue corner,</i>

739
00:38:53,631 --> 00:38:55,200
<i>wearing the silver trunks.</i>

740
00:38:55,800 --> 00:38:58,503
<i>Standing 180 cm tall,</i>

741
00:38:59,437 --> 00:39:01,706
<i>weighing in at 70 kg.</i>

742
00:39:02,674 --> 00:39:05,143
<i>The 2024 National Sports Festival</i>

743
00:39:05,210 --> 00:39:08,046
<i>welterweight boxing gold medalist.</i>

744
00:39:08,112 --> 00:39:10,682
<i>With body shots so deadly,</i>

745
00:39:10,748 --> 00:39:12,951
<i>please give it up for Body Killer,</i>

746
00:39:13,751 --> 00:39:19,490
{\an8}<i>Kuk Seungjun!</i>

747
00:39:19,557 --> 00:39:22,026
{\an8}KUK SEUNGJUN'S SISTER

748
00:39:22,594 --> 00:39:25,797
<i>From the red corner,
wearing the yellow trunks.</i>

749
00:39:25,864 --> 00:39:28,399
<i>Standing 180 cm tall,</i>

750
00:39:28,466 --> 00:39:30,301
<i>weighing in at 80 kg.</i>

751
00:39:30,869 --> 00:39:33,771
<i>The current champion
across three Muay Thai organizations,</i>

752
00:39:33,838 --> 00:39:36,641
<i>the last man standing for Muay Thai.</i>

753
00:39:37,175 --> 00:39:39,544
<i>Give it up for Shotgun,</i>

754
00:39:40,044 --> 00:39:45,283
{\an8}<i>Kim Hyunjun!</i>

755
00:39:45,350 --> 00:39:46,951
{\an8}SHOTGUN KIM HYUNJUN

756
00:39:47,652 --> 00:39:49,487
{\an8}TAEHAN MUAY THAI

757
00:39:50,054 --> 00:39:53,391
[Hyunjun] <i>I'm Kim Hyunjun,
current national Muay Thai team member.</i>

758
00:39:55,093 --> 00:39:56,094
<i>E*A,</i>

759
00:39:56,895 --> 00:39:58,162
<i>K*K,</i>

760
00:39:58,229 --> 00:39:59,297
<i>and K*** H***s.</i>

761
00:39:59,364 --> 00:40:00,965
<i>I hold titles in three organizations.</i>

762
00:40:02,367 --> 00:40:04,002
Jab, jab, jab!

763
00:40:04,068 --> 00:40:07,739
I hit with instant explosive force,

764
00:40:08,439 --> 00:40:11,910
hence the ring name "Shotgun."

765
00:40:11,976 --> 00:40:14,045
{\an8}Think of me as Seungjun
and go for the body.

766
00:40:14,112 --> 00:40:15,680
{\an8}KIM TAEHAN
KIM HYUNJUN'S MUAY THAI MASTER

767
00:40:16,247 --> 00:40:18,182
[Hyunjun] <i>Since Kuk Seungjun is tall,</i>

768
00:40:18,249 --> 00:40:22,320
<i>I mostly practiced punching
upward.</i> [grunting]

769
00:40:22,387 --> 00:40:25,957
<i>Given his ring name, "Body Killer,"</i>

770
00:40:26,024 --> 00:40:28,526
<i>I figure if I take the fight inside,</i>

771
00:40:28,593 --> 00:40:30,128
<i>I've got a real shot at winning.</i>

772
00:40:30,695 --> 00:40:34,365
I want him to get a taste of my power.

773
00:40:36,801 --> 00:40:40,071
[Seungjun] <i>I'm Kuk Seungjun
of the Hwasun County Boxing Team.</i>

774
00:40:40,138 --> 00:40:44,509
<i>I won gold medals in both high school
and university divisions at the KNSF.</i>

775
00:40:46,945 --> 00:40:50,181
<i>My main weapon is the body shot.</i>

776
00:40:51,282 --> 00:40:53,384
That's why I went with "Body Killer."

777
00:40:53,885 --> 00:40:55,887
Since it's a six three-minute bout,

778
00:40:55,954 --> 00:40:57,655
you can't waste your stamina.

779
00:40:57,722 --> 00:40:59,724
{\an8}Keep moving as you throw.

780
00:41:00,892 --> 00:41:04,228
[Seungjun] <i>Kim Hyunjun is
in a higher weight class than me,</i>

781
00:41:04,295 --> 00:41:08,399
<i>so I prepared by doing longer rounds
with a heavier sparring partner.</i>

782
00:41:09,567 --> 00:41:11,269
That's the only way to get him!

783
00:41:12,103 --> 00:41:15,940
When it comes to boxing,
I think I've got a definite advantage.

784
00:41:18,343 --> 00:41:22,180
[Jongkook] Before we start,
let's hear what the fighters have to say.

785
00:41:22,246 --> 00:41:25,616
[Hyunjun] I climbed past
a lot of heavy hitters to get here.

786
00:41:25,683 --> 00:41:27,618
No knees, no kicks.

787
00:41:27,685 --> 00:41:31,489
I'll put him down using only my fists.

788
00:41:32,457 --> 00:41:34,792
[audience cheering]

789
00:41:37,228 --> 00:41:41,366
To a Muay Thai fighter
who trains with both hands and feet,

790
00:41:41,933 --> 00:41:46,504
I'll demonstrate the beauty of boxing,
where we train only with these fists.

791
00:41:46,571 --> 00:41:47,839
[audience] Ooh!

792
00:41:47,905 --> 00:41:49,907
[cheering]

793
00:41:51,943 --> 00:41:53,378
Their lines are getting good.

794
00:41:55,179 --> 00:41:57,248
[Seungheon]
The first match prepared for today

795
00:41:57,315 --> 00:41:59,283
is between Kuk Seungjun and Kim Hyunjun.

796
00:41:59,350 --> 00:42:03,788
One of the biggest factors this time is
that it's a six three-minute round bout.

797
00:42:03,855 --> 00:42:07,358
[Gyuwon] Exactly. The sixth round
will be the biggest factor.

798
00:42:07,425 --> 00:42:10,228
- Kuk Seungjun is used to three-rounders.
- [Seungheon] Right.

799
00:42:10,294 --> 00:42:12,130
[Gyuwon] This is his first six-rounder.

800
00:42:12,196 --> 00:42:15,233
I'm curious if he will be able
to withstand the pressure.

801
00:42:15,299 --> 00:42:18,102
[Seungheon]
Meanwhile, Kim Hyunjun's strengths

802
00:42:18,169 --> 00:42:21,205
are his endurance and relentlessness.

803
00:42:21,272 --> 00:42:25,977
I'm really looking forward to seeing
how he's adapted to the boxing rules.

804
00:42:26,044 --> 00:42:28,946
Seungjun is tall and has long reach,
but he's no out-boxer.

805
00:42:29,013 --> 00:42:31,749
- He just crashes in and brawls.
- That's right.

806
00:42:31,816 --> 00:42:35,286
- So this fight should be super fiery.
- [Jongkook] It'll be fun.

807
00:42:35,353 --> 00:42:36,788
Yeah, real fiery.

808
00:42:36,854 --> 00:42:38,556
{\an8}You can turn into it and swing.

809
00:42:38,623 --> 00:42:39,991
{\an8}Don't just stay square.

810
00:42:41,225 --> 00:42:42,660
And don't play in the center.

811
00:42:42,727 --> 00:42:44,896
Push him to the corner.

812
00:42:45,363 --> 00:42:47,732
{\an8}You have plenty of time
to show your skill, okay?

813
00:42:47,799 --> 00:42:50,501
Lure him in, tag with your lead hand.

814
00:42:50,568 --> 00:42:51,903
Rotate, then rip the body.

815
00:42:51,969 --> 00:42:54,105
Who's your bet? My vote's on Shotgun.

816
00:42:55,740 --> 00:42:56,741
You too?

817
00:42:57,275 --> 00:42:59,143
[Jongkook]
The quarterfinals of <i>I Am Boxer</i>.

818
00:43:00,144 --> 00:43:02,780
Let the fight begin!

819
00:43:03,614 --> 00:43:05,616
[audience cheering, applauding]

820
00:43:09,887 --> 00:43:10,988
[in English] Box!

821
00:43:11,055 --> 00:43:12,356
{\an8}[bell dings]

822
00:43:12,423 --> 00:43:14,158
{\an8}KIM HYUNJUN X KUK SEUNGJUN

823
00:43:14,225 --> 00:43:16,527
{\an8}[Seungheon, in Korean] Here come
both fighters for the first round.

824
00:43:18,563 --> 00:43:22,033
{\an8}Kuk Seungjun starts off with a jab
to the body using his long reach.

825
00:43:22,600 --> 00:43:23,668
Sticking light jabs.

826
00:43:23,734 --> 00:43:26,337
Curious to see how his opponent
plans to get past that reach.

827
00:43:28,573 --> 00:43:31,409
- He's using his footwork today.
- Mmm.

828
00:43:31,476 --> 00:43:34,512
[Lee] With the larger ring,
he's really making use of his footwork.

829
00:43:34,979 --> 00:43:36,547
[Jongkook] He's going a bit out-boxer.

830
00:43:37,415 --> 00:43:39,417
[Seungjun]
<i>When it comes to boxing distance,</i>

831
00:43:39,484 --> 00:43:41,719
<i>that's where I've got the edge.</i>

832
00:43:42,353 --> 00:43:46,591
<i>My plan was to establish my range
and run the fight from there.</i>

833
00:43:47,191 --> 00:43:48,192
[Gyuwon] Nice body shot!

834
00:43:48,259 --> 00:43:50,461
- That was perfect timing.
- [Seungheon] Indeed.

835
00:43:51,829 --> 00:43:52,830
[Lee] That's it.

836
00:43:53,531 --> 00:43:55,266
Strike and keep pivoting.

837
00:43:56,134 --> 00:43:58,636
[♪ tense music playing]

838
00:44:02,640 --> 00:44:06,711
Kuk Seungjun's jabbing
to bait him in a little.

839
00:44:07,278 --> 00:44:10,515
And Kim Hyunjun looks like
he's loading up for a big shot.

840
00:44:10,581 --> 00:44:11,682
- [audience gasps]
- Just like that.

841
00:44:13,384 --> 00:44:14,585
Oh.

842
00:44:14,652 --> 00:44:16,354
[Jonghoon] Relax, he missed! Take it easy.

843
00:44:19,690 --> 00:44:21,025
[audience member] He's coming!

844
00:44:21,092 --> 00:44:22,493
[audience gasps]

845
00:44:23,661 --> 00:44:24,929
[audience gasps]

846
00:44:27,298 --> 00:44:29,901
[Hyunjun]
<i>I thought Seungjun was an infighter,</i>

847
00:44:29,967 --> 00:44:33,037
<i>but when I saw him
trying to fight from a distance,</i>

848
00:44:33,538 --> 00:44:36,207
<i>I knew I had to close the distance.</i>

849
00:44:37,175 --> 00:44:38,176
[trainer] That's it!

850
00:44:38,676 --> 00:44:41,045
Get in there! Don't let him off the hook!

851
00:44:43,681 --> 00:44:44,882
Keep it long!

852
00:44:47,852 --> 00:44:51,989
[Gyuwon] Kim Hyunjun's showing zero fear
of Kuk Seungjun's punches.

853
00:44:54,325 --> 00:44:56,928
[Seungheon] Looks like he's thinking
he can handle the shots.

854
00:44:58,095 --> 00:44:59,230
And he closes in!

855
00:44:59,297 --> 00:45:00,298
[audience member] Nice!

856
00:45:01,299 --> 00:45:02,934
[Seungheon]
Sharp left hand on Kuk Seungjun!

857
00:45:06,704 --> 00:45:08,372
Whoa, big left landing there.

858
00:45:12,143 --> 00:45:13,277
[audience member] Slip that!

859
00:45:13,344 --> 00:45:16,180
Kim Hyunjun's punches aren't connecting
as much as expected.

860
00:45:16,247 --> 00:45:17,448
He's moving his feet a lot.

861
00:45:17,515 --> 00:45:20,051
- You mean Kuk Seungjun? I see.
- Yeah.

862
00:45:20,117 --> 00:45:22,253
[Dex] He's constantly going
for that hit-and-move.

863
00:45:22,320 --> 00:45:25,056
[Lee]
He's constantly circling left and right.

864
00:45:25,122 --> 00:45:26,924
- The hit-and-move.
- [Dex exclaims]

865
00:45:26,991 --> 00:45:29,694
Hyunjun can't get the distance.
He hasn't found his range at all.

866
00:45:29,760 --> 00:45:31,329
{\an8}[Dex] He's gotta be thrown off.

867
00:45:35,199 --> 00:45:37,101
{\an8}[Lee] Look, those kinds of body shots.

868
00:45:37,168 --> 00:45:38,502
{\an8}He's hunting for those.

869
00:45:41,405 --> 00:45:43,040
{\an8}- [bell dings]
- [referee, in English] Okay, stop!

870
00:45:43,107 --> 00:45:45,276
[Seungheon, in Korean]
And that's the end of the first round!

871
00:45:45,343 --> 00:45:46,344
[audience cheers]

872
00:45:46,410 --> 00:45:50,147
[Gyuwon] That was a first round
fought like a final round.

873
00:45:50,648 --> 00:45:54,051
[Seungheon] Kim Hyunjun pushed forward
and tried to take control,

874
00:45:54,118 --> 00:45:56,754
but Kuk Seungjun's pinpoint shots
were incredibly impressive.

875
00:45:56,821 --> 00:45:59,790
What's smart about Kuk Seungjun's play is,

876
00:45:59,857 --> 00:46:01,859
when we gave him a small ring,

877
00:46:01,926 --> 00:46:03,628
- he fought inside.
- Yeah.

878
00:46:03,694 --> 00:46:04,895
Now that the ring is big,

879
00:46:04,962 --> 00:46:06,497
- he's showing much more movement.
- Mmm.

880
00:46:06,564 --> 00:46:10,968
You're fighting great right now,
but you get clipped when you get out.

881
00:46:11,035 --> 00:46:12,770
- Watch out for that, okay?
- [Seungjun] Okay.

882
00:46:13,371 --> 00:46:15,006
<i>I'm thinking if I keep this up,</i>

883
00:46:15,072 --> 00:46:18,542
<i>I should have the edge in this fight.</i>

884
00:46:18,609 --> 00:46:21,078
[trainer] He keeps throwing jabs.
That's when you should stick it.

885
00:46:21,145 --> 00:46:22,713
Don't try to end it with one shot.

886
00:46:22,780 --> 00:46:24,181
Make your moment, got it?

887
00:46:24,749 --> 00:46:27,752
[Hyunjun] <i>Right now,
I'm losing on distance and footwork,</i>

888
00:46:28,352 --> 00:46:30,087
<i>so I have to dig further in.</i>

889
00:46:30,721 --> 00:46:31,889
[whistle blows]

890
00:46:31,956 --> 00:46:34,058
All right, let's start the second round!

891
00:46:34,125 --> 00:46:36,394
[audience cheering, applauding]

892
00:46:38,896 --> 00:46:40,998
{\an8}- [bell dings]
- [Seungheon] The second round begins.

893
00:46:41,065 --> 00:46:44,302
{\an8}KIM HYUNJUN X KUK SEUNGJUN

894
00:46:44,769 --> 00:46:47,038
{\an8}BOXING SCORE CARD
KIM: 9, KUK: 10

895
00:46:47,104 --> 00:46:49,240
{\an8}[Jongkook] That's it.
You have to just go for it.

896
00:46:49,707 --> 00:46:51,175
- [audience member] Go in further!
- Right.

897
00:46:51,242 --> 00:46:52,443
[Lee] He's pivoting.

898
00:46:52,510 --> 00:46:54,178
[Jonghoon] Okay, nice body shot!

899
00:46:54,245 --> 00:46:55,780
[Dex] Yes, there it is.

900
00:46:55,846 --> 00:46:57,948
[Seungheon] He's now using
his footwork more. Falling back.

901
00:46:58,015 --> 00:46:59,350
And another body shot!

902
00:46:59,950 --> 00:47:01,285
[audience member] All right!

903
00:47:01,986 --> 00:47:03,621
He's starting to work the body.

904
00:47:04,188 --> 00:47:07,858
[Seungjun]
<i>With Hyunjun coming forward aggressively,</i>

905
00:47:07,925 --> 00:47:12,697
<i>I took a step back
and worked my specialty, the body shots.</i>

906
00:47:13,664 --> 00:47:15,199
[audience member] That's it!

907
00:47:19,804 --> 00:47:21,272
- [audience member 2] There you go!
- Ooh.

908
00:47:22,139 --> 00:47:24,942
[Gyuwon] That body shot landed
right in the gut!

909
00:47:25,009 --> 00:47:26,177
[audience member] Move away!

910
00:47:26,243 --> 00:47:27,378
[Lee, Dex gasping]

911
00:47:28,145 --> 00:47:30,114
[Dex] He's definitely feeling it now.

912
00:47:33,317 --> 00:47:34,785
[Seungheon]
Kuk Seungjun drifts to the back.

913
00:47:34,852 --> 00:47:37,388
[Hyunjun] <i>I pushed in harder
than in the first round,</i>

914
00:47:37,455 --> 00:47:40,624
<i>but Seungjun's footwork was too good,
I couldn't catch him.</i>

915
00:47:41,225 --> 00:47:43,394
<i>I knew I had to stop him somehow.</i>

916
00:47:43,461 --> 00:47:44,662
<i>So I decided to corner him.</i>

917
00:47:44,729 --> 00:47:46,163
[audience member] All right!

918
00:47:46,230 --> 00:47:48,599
[Seungheon]
Kim Hyunjun fires back! Left and right!

919
00:47:48,666 --> 00:47:51,535
He's got to really pressure him
to drain his gas tank.

920
00:47:51,602 --> 00:47:55,172
Kim Hyunjun's not going to
run out of steam easily.

921
00:47:56,474 --> 00:47:58,442
[Dex] He's got solid durability too.

922
00:48:01,212 --> 00:48:02,613
[Seungheon exclaims]

923
00:48:03,781 --> 00:48:05,249
[Seungheon exclaims]

924
00:48:05,950 --> 00:48:07,151
[audience gasps]

925
00:48:07,218 --> 00:48:08,486
Go for it! Yes, go for it!

926
00:48:08,552 --> 00:48:09,720
- There you go.
- That's it.

927
00:48:09,787 --> 00:48:11,355
Can't just sit and wait, you know.

928
00:48:11,422 --> 00:48:13,557
[Seungheon] Kim Hyunjun
threads that left in beautifully!

929
00:48:14,525 --> 00:48:15,526
Nice body shot!

930
00:48:16,594 --> 00:48:17,595
[Gyuwon exclaims]

931
00:48:19,964 --> 00:48:21,899
[Seungheon] Neither fighter is
fighting for points.

932
00:48:21,966 --> 00:48:24,902
They want real damage
that could lead to a knockdown.

933
00:48:28,572 --> 00:48:32,176
[Gyuwon] Kim Hyunjun's adding pressure,
and it's genuinely terrifying.

934
00:48:32,243 --> 00:48:37,148
That's probably making it tough
for Kuk Seungjun to find clean openings.

935
00:48:43,120 --> 00:48:44,121
{\an8}- [bell dings]
- Stop!

936
00:48:44,188 --> 00:48:45,890
{\an8}[Seungheon] And just like that,
the round ends!

937
00:48:45,956 --> 00:48:47,958
[audience cheering, applauding]

938
00:48:50,027 --> 00:48:51,595
Keep it rough like that.

939
00:48:51,662 --> 00:48:54,064
And you have to fire back
when he comes in.

940
00:48:54,131 --> 00:48:57,201
Hard to tell
where Hyunjun's stamina is right now.

941
00:48:57,268 --> 00:48:59,837
He might look fine,
but he has still taken a few to the body.

942
00:48:59,904 --> 00:49:01,572
- Little by little, that adds up.
- Right.

943
00:49:01,639 --> 00:49:05,543
Those body shots are starting
to take their toll, I believe.

944
00:49:05,609 --> 00:49:07,044
Even for someone like him.

945
00:49:07,111 --> 00:49:09,480
[Hyunjun] <i>Seungjun's punches
weren't painful per se.</i>

946
00:49:09,547 --> 00:49:12,216
But when you keep eating them,
it gets annoying.

947
00:49:12,283 --> 00:49:14,985
<i>Since he knows
I'm hunting for that big shot,</i>

948
00:49:15,052 --> 00:49:17,988
<i>I figured I'd have to sneak it in
in the third round.</i>

949
00:49:18,055 --> 00:49:19,223
You're doing well.

950
00:49:19,290 --> 00:49:21,358
Keep the footwork under control.
He's easy to read.

951
00:49:21,425 --> 00:49:22,626
- Am I right?
- Right.

952
00:49:23,561 --> 00:49:25,196
[Seungjun] <i>The plan was to conserve energy</i>

953
00:49:25,696 --> 00:49:27,097
<i>and keep movement to a minimum.</i>

954
00:49:27,164 --> 00:49:28,365
Fight with confidence, kid.

955
00:49:29,366 --> 00:49:32,503
[Seungheon] Let's see how Round 3 unfolds.
Round 3 coming up next.

956
00:49:32,570 --> 00:49:33,771
Let's go, Seungjun!

957
00:49:35,906 --> 00:49:38,375
I'm curious to see
how Kuk Seungjun handles this round.

958
00:49:38,442 --> 00:49:39,443
{\an8}[bell dings]

959
00:49:39,510 --> 00:49:40,511
{\an8}KIM HYUNJUN X KUK SEUNGJUN

960
00:49:40,578 --> 00:49:41,779
{\an8}[Seungheon] Round 3 has begun.

961
00:49:41,846 --> 00:49:43,380
{\an8}Kim guards up and goes back in.

962
00:49:43,447 --> 00:49:47,184
{\an8}[Gyuwon] Round 3 is going to be
crucial for both fighters.

963
00:49:51,088 --> 00:49:52,957
[audience member] All right! Nice shot!

964
00:49:53,624 --> 00:49:56,560
- [audience member 2] That's it!
- [audience member 3] You're good!

965
00:49:57,027 --> 00:49:58,462
Don't trade with him!

966
00:49:59,930 --> 00:50:01,999
[Seungheon]
He digs inside, aiming upstairs.

967
00:50:02,066 --> 00:50:03,534
Kuk Seungjun backs out.

968
00:50:03,601 --> 00:50:05,603
[♪ dramatic music playing]

969
00:50:06,604 --> 00:50:09,173
- [Dex exclaims]
- [exclaims] Nice.

970
00:50:09,807 --> 00:50:11,709
[Lee] Kim tried to corner him,
but Kuk got out.

971
00:50:12,543 --> 00:50:13,544
[Jongkook exclaims]

972
00:50:14,044 --> 00:50:16,280
Look at Hyunjun,
countering right back to the body.

973
00:50:16,347 --> 00:50:17,982
[audience member] Nice, there you go!

974
00:50:18,616 --> 00:50:20,284
- [Seungheon] Excellent uppercut!
- [exclaims]

975
00:50:20,351 --> 00:50:22,353
[audience gasping]

976
00:50:24,588 --> 00:50:25,890
[Lee exclaims]

977
00:50:25,956 --> 00:50:27,992
[Gyuwon] That was an excellent uppercut!

978
00:50:30,094 --> 00:50:32,096
[audience exclaiming]

979
00:50:37,601 --> 00:50:39,169
[Lee] Well, that was neat!

980
00:50:39,870 --> 00:50:41,205
That one-two was sharp.

981
00:50:43,874 --> 00:50:47,211
[Gyuwon] Kim Hyunjun's still taunting,
but he can't afford to eat shots here!

982
00:50:49,013 --> 00:50:50,281
That connected!

983
00:50:52,049 --> 00:50:54,184
[exclaiming]

984
00:50:55,753 --> 00:50:59,657
[Gyuwon] But it seems
Kim Hyunjun is tracking every punch.

985
00:50:59,723 --> 00:51:01,425
The shots you see won't drop you.

986
00:51:01,492 --> 00:51:02,726
[Seungheon] That's right.

987
00:51:02,793 --> 00:51:04,061
Let's go, Hyunjun!

988
00:51:04,695 --> 00:51:06,030
You got this, Seungjun!

989
00:51:06,530 --> 00:51:08,532
[♪ intense music playing]

990
00:51:11,335 --> 00:51:13,070
[audience member] All right!
Use the rear hand!

991
00:51:13,137 --> 00:51:14,738
[Dex] Seungjun's running out of steam now.

992
00:51:14,805 --> 00:51:16,540
[Lee] He's slowing down a bit.

993
00:51:16,607 --> 00:51:18,542
- [audience member] Use your rear hand!
- All right!

994
00:51:18,609 --> 00:51:20,110
- [Lee exclaims]
- [Seungheon] Nice sway.

995
00:51:20,177 --> 00:51:23,013
- [audience gasping]
- [exclaims, chuckles]

996
00:51:27,151 --> 00:51:28,886
[Gyuwon] That sway is an indicator

997
00:51:28,953 --> 00:51:31,088
that he's figured out
Kuk Seungjun's rhythm.

998
00:51:31,155 --> 00:51:34,158
[Seungheon] That's right.
And Kuk Seungjun is looking visibly tired.

999
00:51:35,659 --> 00:51:38,796
[Lee] Seungjun needs to tighten his guard
and start engaging.

1000
00:51:41,532 --> 00:51:43,100
{\an8}[Seungheon] Guard up, back in he goes.

1001
00:51:43,167 --> 00:51:44,535
{\an8}He keeps going to the left.

1002
00:51:44,602 --> 00:51:46,570
{\an8}He's pushing hard. Going back in.

1003
00:51:46,637 --> 00:51:48,405
[Dex, spectators exclaim]

1004
00:51:48,472 --> 00:51:51,709
{\an8}- [bell dings]
- [Seungheon] And that wraps up this round.

1005
00:51:51,775 --> 00:51:53,310
[applause]

1006
00:51:53,377 --> 00:51:59,350
{\an8}BOXING SCORE CARD
KIM: 27, GUK: 30

1007
00:51:59,416 --> 00:52:01,352
[spectator 1] Hey, he's good.
He's really good.

1008
00:52:01,418 --> 00:52:02,553
- This is fun.
- It really is.

1009
00:52:02,620 --> 00:52:03,621
Totally.

1010
00:52:03,687 --> 00:52:04,855
It's just getting started.

1011
00:52:05,289 --> 00:52:07,458
It's hard to tell
how Rounds 4 and 5 will go.

1012
00:52:07,524 --> 00:52:10,661
- Right, yeah.
- It'd be easier if there was a clear edge.

1013
00:52:10,728 --> 00:52:12,563
You don't have to chase him.

1014
00:52:12,630 --> 00:52:14,264
He'll come to you anyway. Why rush in?

1015
00:52:14,331 --> 00:52:16,233
Just throw one or two more than him.

1016
00:52:16,300 --> 00:52:17,368
- Got it?
- Yes.

1017
00:52:17,434 --> 00:52:18,769
Don't fight at range.

1018
00:52:18,836 --> 00:52:20,804
You can't throw at range.

1019
00:52:21,271 --> 00:52:23,007
[Hyunjun] <i>The feeling-out rounds are over.</i>

1020
00:52:23,073 --> 00:52:24,708
<i>Now the real fight begins.</i>

1021
00:52:24,775 --> 00:52:26,243
From here on out, this is my stage.

1022
00:52:26,310 --> 00:52:27,578
<i>I'm going to light it up.</i>

1023
00:52:27,645 --> 00:52:29,613
- [spectators cheering]
- [applause]

1024
00:52:30,714 --> 00:52:32,349
{\an8}ROUND 4 OF 6
KIM HYUNJUN X KUK SEUNGJUN

1025
00:52:32,416 --> 00:52:35,786
{\an8}[Gyuwon] This is the round
Kim Hyunjun has been waiting for.

1026
00:52:36,387 --> 00:52:37,454
[spectator] All right!

1027
00:52:37,955 --> 00:52:39,123
Rough and aggressive!

1028
00:52:39,189 --> 00:52:40,791
Perfect! Keep that up!

1029
00:52:40,858 --> 00:52:42,860
Man, look at him go right from the start.

1030
00:52:43,961 --> 00:52:45,696
- He's going in! Body shot!
- [spectators exclaim]

1031
00:52:46,230 --> 00:52:47,798
[spectators exclaiming]

1032
00:52:50,300 --> 00:52:51,301
[spectator 1] That landed!

1033
00:52:51,769 --> 00:52:53,737
[spectator 2] Hyunjun,
stay rough! Throw them in pairs!

1034
00:52:54,171 --> 00:52:56,140
Looks like he's been saving energy.

1035
00:52:58,542 --> 00:52:59,610
[Seungheon] Here he comes!

1036
00:52:59,677 --> 00:53:01,045
[spectators exclaim]

1037
00:53:01,111 --> 00:53:02,446
Whoa, that landed.

1038
00:53:03,380 --> 00:53:05,215
[Seungjun] <i>I felt
like I was finding my groove...</i>

1039
00:53:05,282 --> 00:53:06,350
[exclaiming continues]

1040
00:53:06,417 --> 00:53:08,218
[Seungjun] <i>...but then I ended
up eating a big one.</i>

1041
00:53:08,919 --> 00:53:10,421
<i>I'm like, "He's got insane power."</i>

1042
00:53:10,487 --> 00:53:12,823
<i>"If that lands clean, I'm in trouble."</i>

1043
00:53:12,890 --> 00:53:14,124
He's falling for the same shot.

1044
00:53:14,191 --> 00:53:15,592
He could use more head movement.

1045
00:53:15,659 --> 00:53:16,660
[spectator 1] All right!

1046
00:53:19,096 --> 00:53:23,333
[Hyunjun] <i>Kuk Seungjun kept running
around during the first three rounds,</i>

1047
00:53:23,400 --> 00:53:26,870
<i>so once we hit Round 4,
he was clearly gassed.</i>

1048
00:53:27,571 --> 00:53:30,641
<i>I hadn't even used half my tank,</i>

1049
00:53:30,708 --> 00:53:33,277
so I had the edge in stamina.

1050
00:53:34,812 --> 00:53:36,113
[Seungheon] Now he presses forward.

1051
00:53:36,180 --> 00:53:38,115
Kuk Seungjun goes in
and lands a great body shot!

1052
00:53:38,182 --> 00:53:39,183
Circle out of there!

1053
00:53:39,249 --> 00:53:40,851
Kim Hyunjun fires back with an uppercut!

1054
00:53:42,186 --> 00:53:44,354
Kim Hyunjun fires back with an uppercut!

1055
00:53:44,421 --> 00:53:46,056
He's got to watch that hand.

1056
00:53:46,123 --> 00:53:47,925
Eyes on his chest! Push in!

1057
00:53:48,592 --> 00:53:49,827
[spectator 2] Nice shot!

1058
00:53:50,461 --> 00:53:51,628
[spectator 3] Keep going!

1059
00:53:52,496 --> 00:53:54,164
His shots aren't landing though.

1060
00:53:54,231 --> 00:53:55,532
There's no weight behind them.

1061
00:53:56,533 --> 00:53:57,801
[Lee] He's burned a lot of energy.

1062
00:53:57,868 --> 00:53:59,403
He keeps leaning forward like that.

1063
00:53:59,470 --> 00:54:00,871
That's how you get tagged big.

1064
00:54:01,472 --> 00:54:03,440
[spectator 1] Backhand, counter!

1065
00:54:03,941 --> 00:54:05,576
[spectator 2] Nice! That's it!

1066
00:54:06,210 --> 00:54:07,411
Doing good, Seungjun!

1067
00:54:08,479 --> 00:54:09,713
{\an8}Ten seconds!

1068
00:54:11,381 --> 00:54:13,517
{\an8}[Jongkook] He's swinging big.

1069
00:54:17,321 --> 00:54:18,322
[bell dings]

1070
00:54:18,388 --> 00:54:20,724
{\an8}- Stop!
- [Seungheon] And that concludes the round!

1071
00:54:20,791 --> 00:54:22,126
[applause]

1072
00:54:24,294 --> 00:54:25,929
This is gonna be tough to call.

1073
00:54:25,996 --> 00:54:27,631
We're already in the fifth. What now?

1074
00:54:27,698 --> 00:54:29,500
- [Jongkook chuckles]
- [sighs]

1075
00:54:29,967 --> 00:54:32,503
[Seungjun] <i>Honestly,
I was starting to gas out.</i>

1076
00:54:32,569 --> 00:54:34,238
<i>So I told myself to lock in.</i>

1077
00:54:34,304 --> 00:54:35,773
[Hyunjun] <i>I managed to land a big shot,</i>

1078
00:54:35,839 --> 00:54:37,608
<i>so I just needed to keep it up.</i>

1079
00:54:37,674 --> 00:54:38,976
[bell dings]

1080
00:54:39,042 --> 00:54:40,077
Now, the fifth round.

1081
00:54:40,144 --> 00:54:41,278
[spectators exclaiming]

1082
00:54:41,345 --> 00:54:44,248
{\an8}BOXING SCORE CARD
KIM: 37, KUK: 39

1083
00:54:46,316 --> 00:54:47,518
[spectator 3] Man, that was close!

1084
00:54:49,686 --> 00:54:51,021
[Jongkook] He slipped well this time.

1085
00:54:55,325 --> 00:54:57,194
You've gotta go. Yes, go now.

1086
00:54:58,629 --> 00:55:01,431
[Seungheon] Kim Hyunjun charges
forward relentlessly.

1087
00:55:01,498 --> 00:55:02,966
[Lee] Hey, careful, careful.

1088
00:55:03,033 --> 00:55:04,234
Stop!

1089
00:55:06,036 --> 00:55:07,571
[Dex] They both seem a bit tired.

1090
00:55:07,638 --> 00:55:09,339
All right, box!

1091
00:55:09,840 --> 00:55:10,908
[referee] Go in now!

1092
00:55:10,974 --> 00:55:12,109
[spectator 1] That's it!

1093
00:55:14,077 --> 00:55:15,078
[Dex] Oh, boy.

1094
00:55:15,445 --> 00:55:16,446
Is he bleeding?

1095
00:55:16,513 --> 00:55:19,583
[gasps] His fighting spirit is insane.

1096
00:55:19,650 --> 00:55:21,652
[Dex exclaiming]

1097
00:55:23,053 --> 00:55:24,288
[spectator 1] That was...

1098
00:55:24,354 --> 00:55:26,456
That same shot keeps landing.

1099
00:55:26,924 --> 00:55:29,927
[Seungjun] <i>He was throwing
at strange beats, and it threw me off.</i>

1100
00:55:29,993 --> 00:55:31,428
<i>I couldn't afford to lose focus.</i>

1101
00:55:31,495 --> 00:55:32,496
[spectator 1] Great!

1102
00:55:32,563 --> 00:55:33,964
[spectator 2] All right!

1103
00:55:34,031 --> 00:55:35,899
[Seungheon] Once he got
that distance down,

1104
00:55:35,966 --> 00:55:38,368
he's landing with more effect now.

1105
00:55:39,269 --> 00:55:40,704
He just keeps coming.

1106
00:55:47,477 --> 00:55:48,512
[referee] Careful, the head!

1107
00:55:48,579 --> 00:55:49,847
- [exclaims]
- Man, they've headbutted.

1108
00:55:49,913 --> 00:55:51,281
There must've been a headbutt.

1109
00:55:51,915 --> 00:55:53,350
[Gyuwon] That was a heavy collision.

1110
00:55:53,417 --> 00:55:55,152
When you charge in like that...

1111
00:55:55,686 --> 00:55:59,289
This happens all the time in pro boxing.

1112
00:55:59,356 --> 00:56:00,557
[Seungheon] That's right.

1113
00:56:00,624 --> 00:56:02,626
{\an8}[referee] Hold on.
Let's wipe the blood off.

1114
00:56:03,527 --> 00:56:05,762
Well, that wasn't intentional.

1115
00:56:06,363 --> 00:56:08,031
[bell dings]

1116
00:56:08,098 --> 00:56:09,166
[Lee] All right.

1117
00:56:09,233 --> 00:56:10,701
[applause]

1118
00:56:10,767 --> 00:56:16,807
{\an8}BOXING SCORE CARD
KIM: 47, KUK: 48

1119
00:56:16,874 --> 00:56:18,342
This is tricky.

1120
00:56:18,408 --> 00:56:20,677
Do we judge on impact

1121
00:56:20,744 --> 00:56:22,412
- or ring control?
- Right.

1122
00:56:22,479 --> 00:56:24,882
[coach] This is the final round, okay?

1123
00:56:24,948 --> 00:56:25,983
Just score points.

1124
00:56:26,049 --> 00:56:27,584
Go in confident.

1125
00:56:27,651 --> 00:56:30,187
- Like you're going for the KO.
- Got it.

1126
00:56:30,954 --> 00:56:31,955
Deep breaths now.

1127
00:56:32,456 --> 00:56:33,891
Pour it all out in the last round.

1128
00:56:33,957 --> 00:56:35,359
Dive headfirst, but don't lift.

1129
00:56:35,425 --> 00:56:37,060
Just dive in and pour it all out.

1130
00:56:37,127 --> 00:56:39,096
- It's over anyway, okay?
- Got it.

1131
00:56:39,162 --> 00:56:40,964
This is the final round.
Let's hear it, everyone!

1132
00:56:41,031 --> 00:56:42,799
- [spectators cheering]
- [applause]

1133
00:56:42,866 --> 00:56:45,168
[Seungheon] Only the sixth
and final round remains.

1134
00:56:46,203 --> 00:56:48,972
Shotgun, Kim Hyunjun versus
Body Killer, Kuk Seungjun!

1135
00:56:49,806 --> 00:56:51,441
Let's go, Hyunjun!

1136
00:56:51,508 --> 00:56:52,743
[spectator] You got this, Seungjun!

1137
00:56:56,013 --> 00:56:58,849
[Hyunjun] <i>If I don't show it now,
I never will.</i>

1138
00:56:58,916 --> 00:57:02,085
<i>So I'm gonna squeeze out every last drop
in this final round.</i>

1139
00:57:03,053 --> 00:57:05,022
[Seungjun] <i>I've got to dig deep now.</i>

1140
00:57:06,156 --> 00:57:09,126
<i>I'll pour everything into this last round.</i>

1141
00:57:09,927 --> 00:57:11,295
{\an8}ROUND 6 OF 6
KIM HYUNJUN X KUK SEUNGJUN

1142
00:57:11,361 --> 00:57:13,363
{\an8}[Seungheon] It's the final round.

1143
00:57:13,430 --> 00:57:14,631
{\an8}Here we go.

1144
00:57:14,698 --> 00:57:16,500
- [spectators cheering]
- [applause]

1145
00:57:16,566 --> 00:57:18,769
[Gyuwon] A gesture
of respect from both fighters.

1146
00:57:18,835 --> 00:57:20,537
[spectators exclaiming]

1147
00:57:20,604 --> 00:57:21,838
Okay, let's go!

1148
00:57:21,905 --> 00:57:23,073
Here we go.

1149
00:57:24,541 --> 00:57:26,443
Stepping forward,
Kim Hyunjun moves in tight.

1150
00:57:27,911 --> 00:57:29,813
[Dex] They're lighting it up.

1151
00:57:29,880 --> 00:57:31,581
[Jongkook] Yes, that's how you do it.

1152
00:57:31,648 --> 00:57:32,649
[Lee exclaims]

1153
00:57:32,716 --> 00:57:35,018
[Seungheon] He swings big with the left,
then pulls back!

1154
00:57:35,085 --> 00:57:38,055
Kuk Seungjun presses forward again,
using big upper-body movement!

1155
00:57:38,121 --> 00:57:40,390
While in close,
Kim Hyunjun fires short punches!

1156
00:57:40,457 --> 00:57:42,225
- Doing pretty well.
- I'm proud of him.

1157
00:57:42,292 --> 00:57:43,293
He's good.

1158
00:57:43,894 --> 00:57:44,895
[spectator 1] Very.

1159
00:57:45,429 --> 00:57:46,663
[spectator 2] All right!

1160
00:57:48,799 --> 00:57:51,001
[spectator 3] Yes, that's it! Nice shot!

1161
00:57:51,568 --> 00:57:52,736
[Lee gasps]

1162
00:57:52,803 --> 00:57:55,639
Kuk Seungjun's using
a ton of head movement.

1163
00:57:59,776 --> 00:58:02,412
[Gyuwon] He's waiting for
the right timing, looking to put him down.

1164
00:58:02,913 --> 00:58:04,881
It's the last one,
so they're just going all out.

1165
00:58:04,948 --> 00:58:06,917
No need to think about what comes next.

1166
00:58:08,485 --> 00:58:10,554
[Seungheon] The volume definitely matters,

1167
00:58:10,620 --> 00:58:12,522
but landing clean shots is crucial here!

1168
00:58:13,824 --> 00:58:15,158
[Lee] There you go!

1169
00:58:16,760 --> 00:58:17,761
There you go!

1170
00:58:17,828 --> 00:58:19,196
Work it up and down.

1171
00:58:21,832 --> 00:58:24,601
[Gyuwon] Kuk Seungjun is showing
amazing speed.

1172
00:58:26,703 --> 00:58:30,107
[Seungheon] Kuk Seungjun's finding
a second wind this round.

1173
00:58:30,173 --> 00:58:31,875
[Gyuwon] Real grit he's got there.

1174
00:58:31,942 --> 00:58:33,243
[spectator 1] Nice rhythm!

1175
00:58:33,310 --> 00:58:36,179
- Kuk's more durable than you'd think.
- You're right.

1176
00:58:37,080 --> 00:58:38,448
He just keeps going like that.

1177
00:58:41,351 --> 00:58:43,020
[spectator 1] All right! That's it!

1178
00:58:45,222 --> 00:58:47,657
[Seungheon] Kuk Seungjun is focusing
on volume now.

1179
00:58:52,095 --> 00:58:53,897
[Jongkook exclaiming]

1180
00:58:56,833 --> 00:58:59,269
[Gyuwon] Since Kuk Seungjun is
always the one to land first,

1181
00:58:59,336 --> 00:59:02,339
it's definitely starting
to take a toll on Kim Hyunjun.

1182
00:59:03,340 --> 00:59:04,741
[spectators exclaim]

1183
00:59:04,808 --> 00:59:06,276
- [Dex] It's a slip!
- [spectator 1] Slip!

1184
00:59:06,343 --> 00:59:08,545
- [referee] Get up.
- [spectator 2] Last round, focus!

1185
00:59:08,612 --> 00:59:10,814
[spectators exclaiming continues]

1186
00:59:10,881 --> 00:59:12,315
You got this!

1187
00:59:12,916 --> 00:59:14,317
[spectator] Let's go, Kim Hyunjun!

1188
00:59:15,952 --> 00:59:18,255
[Hyunjun] <i>Don't give up.
Finish it with no regrets.</i>

1189
00:59:18,989 --> 00:59:21,058
[Seungjun] <i>Show
that fighting spirit to the very end.</i>

1190
00:59:22,526 --> 00:59:23,527
[referee] Box!

1191
00:59:24,061 --> 00:59:26,363
[Seungheon] Here comes
the final push from Kim Hyunjun!

1192
00:59:26,430 --> 00:59:28,131
He's targeting the inside. Body again!

1193
00:59:40,077 --> 00:59:41,845
Kuk Seungjun's actually pushing him back.

1194
00:59:41,912 --> 00:59:43,447
Exactly.

1195
00:59:43,513 --> 00:59:44,714
[spectator 1] All right, nice!

1196
00:59:46,616 --> 00:59:47,784
[spectator 2] Keep it up!

1197
00:59:48,919 --> 00:59:49,986
[referee] Break it up!

1198
00:59:52,923 --> 00:59:54,157
[Lee] Look, he's backing up now.

1199
00:59:54,624 --> 00:59:56,293
[Dex] Hyunjun's the one retreating now.

1200
00:59:58,195 --> 00:59:59,262
{\an8}[referee] Ten seconds!

1201
00:59:59,763 --> 01:00:01,364
[spectator 1] Ten seconds!

1202
01:00:15,412 --> 01:00:16,413
[bell dings]

1203
01:00:16,480 --> 01:00:18,482
- Stop!
- [Seungheon] That's it for this fight!

1204
01:00:18,548 --> 01:00:21,551
- The bout has officially ended!
- [spectators cheering]

1205
01:00:21,618 --> 01:00:23,286
- Kuk Seungjun versus Kim Hyunjun!
- [applause]

1206
01:00:23,954 --> 01:00:26,123
[Gyuwon] Wow,
what an incredible back-and-forth!

1207
01:00:34,831 --> 01:00:36,032
[spectator 1] You did awesome!

1208
01:00:36,099 --> 01:00:38,969
[Dex] Fighters,
step to the center, please.

1209
01:00:39,035 --> 01:00:40,303
Let's give them a big hand!

1210
01:00:40,370 --> 01:00:42,172
- [spectators cheering]
- [applause]

1211
01:00:42,239 --> 01:00:44,541
[Gyuwon] This bout goes
beyond wins and losses.

1212
01:00:44,608 --> 01:00:47,611
Both fighters proved themselves.

1213
01:00:48,879 --> 01:00:52,415
Once again,
this was a tough fight to judge.

1214
01:00:52,482 --> 01:00:55,552
Thank you both
for giving your absolute best.

1215
01:00:57,587 --> 01:01:01,057
{\an8}- We will now announce the result.
- [sighs]

1216
01:01:03,693 --> 01:01:05,695
[Jongkook] Judge one scores it for...

1217
01:01:09,132 --> 01:01:10,800
{\an8}Kuk Seungjun from the blue corner.

1218
01:01:10,867 --> 01:01:12,869
{\an8}JUDGE 1
BLUE CORNER KUK SEUNGJUN WINS

1219
01:01:12,936 --> 01:01:14,938
- [spectators cheering]
- [applause]

1220
01:01:17,607 --> 01:01:20,277
[Dex] Judge two scores it for...

1221
01:01:25,615 --> 01:01:27,517
{\an8}Kim Hyunjun from the red corner!

1222
01:01:27,584 --> 01:01:29,219
{\an8}JUDGE 2
RED CORNER KIM HYUNJUN WINS

1223
01:01:29,286 --> 01:01:31,655
- [spectators cheering]
- [applause]

1224
01:01:35,492 --> 01:01:36,593
One-one so far.

1225
01:01:36,660 --> 01:01:38,495
God, my head hurts.

1226
01:01:39,296 --> 01:01:41,865
[Jongkook] Lastly, please announce

1227
01:01:41,932 --> 01:01:44,034
the final decision from the third judge.

1228
01:01:45,268 --> 01:01:47,437
[Lee] By judges' decision...

1229
01:01:49,339 --> 01:01:52,342
[Seungjun] <i>I landed more than I took,</i>

1230
01:01:52,409 --> 01:01:53,944
<i>so I think I did well.</i>

1231
01:01:55,011 --> 01:01:57,581
[Hyunjun] <i>I made every shot count,
landing one impactful punch at a time.</i>

1232
01:01:57,647 --> 01:01:59,316
<i>I think I won.</i>

1233
01:02:00,350 --> 01:02:01,718
The winner is...

1234
01:02:08,391 --> 01:02:11,194
{\an8}- Kuk Seungjun from the blue corner.
- [cheering, applause]

1235
01:02:11,261 --> 01:02:12,429
{\an8}Congratulations.

1236
01:02:20,503 --> 01:02:21,504
Well done.

1237
01:02:21,571 --> 01:02:23,139
[cheering continues]

1238
01:02:24,641 --> 01:02:29,246
Boxing isn't
Kim Hyunjun's main discipline,

1239
01:02:29,980 --> 01:02:32,048
so I underestimated him, to be honest.

1240
01:02:33,216 --> 01:02:38,455
But I believe he can stand toe-to-toe
with any boxer out there.

1241
01:02:38,521 --> 01:02:40,023
[sniffs]

1242
01:02:40,090 --> 01:02:41,091
And

1243
01:02:42,459 --> 01:02:45,629
I'd like to say something to my father.

1244
01:02:45,695 --> 01:02:47,397
[breathing heavily]

1245
01:02:48,098 --> 01:02:52,802
Dad, we used to watch
world champions on TV when I was little.

1246
01:02:53,503 --> 01:02:56,806
Do I look as strong and cool as they did?

1247
01:02:59,542 --> 01:03:00,844
Certainly!

1248
01:03:06,549 --> 01:03:09,853
I'll come back even stronger
for the next round.

1249
01:03:09,919 --> 01:03:10,920
Thank you.

1250
01:03:10,987 --> 01:03:12,989
[cheering, applause]

1251
01:03:22,332 --> 01:03:27,304
As a Muay Thai champion,
I thought I'd handle boxing easily.

1252
01:03:27,370 --> 01:03:30,774
But as you can see,
I took way too many shots.

1253
01:03:30,840 --> 01:03:32,042
[chuckles]

1254
01:03:33,209 --> 01:03:35,779
Though my journey ends here,

1255
01:03:35,845 --> 01:03:39,215
I'll continue to shine in Muay Thai,
referred to as Thai boxing.

1256
01:03:39,282 --> 01:03:40,283
Thank you.

1257
01:03:40,350 --> 01:03:42,352
[cheering, applause]

1258
01:03:45,622 --> 01:03:47,791
- You did great!
- Hyunjun, darling! Great job!

1259
01:03:49,626 --> 01:03:50,960
Great job, you two.

1260
01:03:59,736 --> 01:04:02,639
- Aw, look at you. [laughing]
- [laughing]

1261
01:04:03,606 --> 01:04:05,375
You did so well.

1262
01:04:05,442 --> 01:04:06,743
You did wonderfully.

1263
01:04:06,810 --> 01:04:08,144
- Does it hurt?
- I'm fine.

1264
01:04:08,211 --> 01:04:09,245
Hello, sir.

1265
01:04:09,312 --> 01:04:10,313
- Are you sure?
- Yeah.

1266
01:04:10,380 --> 01:04:11,581
You did awesome!

1267
01:04:11,648 --> 01:04:13,750
- You were awesome, Kim Hyunjun!
- You did so well.

1268
01:04:14,351 --> 01:04:15,485
Goodness, that was great.

1269
01:04:16,119 --> 01:04:18,455
[Hyunjun]
I Am Boxer <i>was a huge challenge for me.</i>

1270
01:04:18,521 --> 01:04:22,992
<i>It let me prove all the work I've put in,</i>

1271
01:04:23,059 --> 01:04:25,662
<i>which made it even more fun and rewarding.</i>

1272
01:04:25,729 --> 01:04:26,996
[no audible dialogue]

1273
01:04:28,131 --> 01:04:29,733
Remember how we used to watch

1274
01:04:30,533 --> 01:04:34,137
- the world champions on TV together?
- Yeah.

1275
01:04:34,204 --> 01:04:37,006
- I wanted to do just as well as them.
- You did great.

1276
01:04:37,941 --> 01:04:41,544
- [man] You did well enough.
- [older sister] You did well, really.

1277
01:04:42,045 --> 01:04:43,113
Keep working hard to learn

1278
01:04:43,713 --> 01:04:46,583
and show everything you've got.

1279
01:04:47,283 --> 01:04:49,586
[Seungjun] <i>Only four fighters
are entering the semifinals.</i>

1280
01:04:49,652 --> 01:04:50,754
- One, two, three!
- Let's go!

1281
01:04:50,820 --> 01:04:52,455
[Seungjun] <i>Whoever I'm up against,</i>

1282
01:04:52,522 --> 01:04:54,157
I'll make it to the finals.

1283
01:04:54,224 --> 01:04:55,759
[applause]

1284
01:04:55,825 --> 01:04:59,229
We've got some
very interesting fighters coming up.

1285
01:04:59,295 --> 01:05:01,297
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

1286
01:05:02,198 --> 01:05:06,770
[Dex] You'll be very surprised
by this next fighter.

1287
01:05:08,438 --> 01:05:10,006
[Lee] The quarterfinals of <i>I Am Boxer</i>.

1288
01:05:11,040 --> 01:05:13,176
Let the second bout begin!

1289
01:05:13,243 --> 01:05:14,878
I AM BOXER

1290
01:05:14,944 --> 01:05:16,379
[cheering, applause]

1291
01:05:23,420 --> 01:05:26,689
[Dex] Entering from the blue corner,
Pretty Boy, Cho Hyunjae!

1292
01:05:26,756 --> 01:05:28,792
[♪ rhythmic music playing]

1293
01:05:44,607 --> 01:05:46,376
{\an8}CHO HYUNJAE'S FAMILY

1294
01:05:57,353 --> 01:05:58,822
- Well, he actually is pretty!
- [chuckles]

1295
01:06:03,193 --> 01:06:04,194
[shouts]

1296
01:06:09,532 --> 01:06:11,134
[cheering]

1297
01:06:14,437 --> 01:06:17,140
[Dex] Man, he's oozing confidence.

1298
01:06:18,975 --> 01:06:22,479
[Jongkook]
Here's the fighter facing Cho Hyunjae.

1299
01:06:22,545 --> 01:06:24,547
[cheering, applause]

1300
01:06:25,381 --> 01:06:26,649
[audience gasping]

1301
01:06:26,716 --> 01:06:28,084
Is that Yuk Junseo?

1302
01:06:28,151 --> 01:06:29,452
[giggling]

1303
01:06:31,254 --> 01:06:35,058
[Jongkook] Entering from the red corner,
Blaze, Yuk Junseo!

1304
01:06:35,758 --> 01:06:37,760
[ ♪ intense music playing]

1305
01:06:42,732 --> 01:06:44,734
[cheering, applause]

1306
01:06:46,302 --> 01:06:47,670
{\an8}Let's go, bro!

1307
01:07:01,451 --> 01:07:02,452
Whoo!

1308
01:07:03,119 --> 01:07:05,121
[cheering, applause continues]

1309
01:07:21,404 --> 01:07:22,972
{\an8}I AM BOXER
YUK JUNSEO X CHO HYUNJAE

1310
01:07:23,039 --> 01:07:24,841
{\an8}AGE: 29, 25
HEIGHT: 176 CM, 177 CM

1311
01:07:24,908 --> 01:07:26,709
{\an8}WEIGHT: 67 KG, 64 KG
REACH: 177 CM, 179 CM

1312
01:07:26,776 --> 01:07:28,811
Next up is the second quarterfinal bout.

1313
01:07:28,878 --> 01:07:30,246
Yuk Junseo versus Cho Hyunjae.

1314
01:07:30,313 --> 01:07:32,315
[ ♪ rhythmic music playing]

1315
01:07:33,516 --> 01:07:38,388
Considered one of the top elite boxers,
here's Cho Hyunjae getting warmed up!

1316
01:07:40,089 --> 01:07:44,794
Facing him is Yuk Junseo,
showing confidence and constant growth!

1317
01:07:44,861 --> 01:07:46,529
[spectator 5] Let's go, Yuk Junseo!

1318
01:07:46,596 --> 01:07:47,897
- [spectator 6] Let's go!
- [spectator 7] Let's go!

1319
01:07:48,364 --> 01:07:50,900
- They're nearly identical physically.
- [spectator 2 mumbles]

1320
01:07:51,467 --> 01:07:52,535
[spectator 3] Let's go, Junseo!

1321
01:07:52,602 --> 01:07:53,937
This is gonna be wild.

1322
01:07:54,571 --> 01:07:57,340
[announcer] <i>From the blue corner,
wearing the white trunks.</i>

1323
01:07:57,407 --> 01:07:59,742
<i>Standing 177 cm tall,</i>

1324
01:07:59,809 --> 01:08:02,045
<i>weighing in at 64 kg.</i>

1325
01:08:02,545 --> 01:08:04,581
<i>From Seoul PE Middle and High School,</i>

1326
01:08:04,647 --> 01:08:06,749
<i>former member
of the Yongin University boxing team.</i>

1327
01:08:07,283 --> 01:08:09,686
<i>The 2025 Korean Boxing Association
President's Cup</i>

1328
01:08:09,752 --> 01:08:11,521
<i>lightweight silver medalist!</i>

1329
01:08:12,121 --> 01:08:13,890
<i>A member of the KAFAC,</i>

1330
01:08:14,357 --> 01:08:17,260
<i>his overwhelming speed leaves no openings.</i>

1331
01:08:17,327 --> 01:08:19,996
<i>And that's why his face stays unmarked!</i>

1332
01:08:20,063 --> 01:08:22,298
<i>Please give it up for Pretty Boy!</i>

1333
01:08:22,765 --> 01:08:26,669
{\an8}<i>Cho Hyunjae!</i>

1334
01:08:26,736 --> 01:08:28,304
{\an8}PRETTY BOY CHO HYUNJAE

1335
01:08:28,371 --> 01:08:29,839
[cheering]

1336
01:08:31,107 --> 01:08:33,476
He looks comfortable up there.

1337
01:08:33,543 --> 01:08:36,079
[announcer]
<i>In the red corner, wearing the red trunks.</i>

1338
01:08:36,145 --> 01:08:38,548
<i>Standing 176 cm tall,</i>

1339
01:08:38,615 --> 01:08:40,450
<i>weighing in at 67 kg.</i>

1340
01:08:41,184 --> 01:08:42,919
<i>With just one year into boxing,</i>

1341
01:08:43,553 --> 01:08:46,222
<i>he's an artist reborn as a boxer!</i>

1342
01:08:46,723 --> 01:08:48,291
<i>He relentlessly moves forward</i>

1343
01:08:48,358 --> 01:08:50,293
<i>and fights like a flame!</i>

1344
01:08:50,360 --> 01:08:52,128
<i>Please welcome Blaze!</i>

1345
01:08:52,629 --> 01:08:56,666
{\an8}<i>Yuk Junseo!</i>

1346
01:08:56,733 --> 01:08:58,935
{\an8}BLAZE YUK JUNSEO

1347
01:08:59,002 --> 01:09:01,571
Let's go! You're the man!

1348
01:09:03,339 --> 01:09:05,141
Bell rings, you keep the lead hand active.

1349
01:09:05,208 --> 01:09:07,410
{\an8}Throw some feints
and see how he comes in, okay?

1350
01:09:07,477 --> 01:09:09,979
Wait, the fringe is gonna cause friction.

1351
01:09:10,046 --> 01:09:12,248
Who knows what'll happen? You never know.

1352
01:09:13,383 --> 01:09:15,018
[Jongkook]
The quarterfinals of <i>I Am Boxer</i>.

1353
01:09:16,285 --> 01:09:19,022
Let the fight begin!

1354
01:09:20,790 --> 01:09:23,493
{\an8}Let's go, Yuk Junseo!

1355
01:09:25,194 --> 01:09:26,195
Box!

1356
01:09:26,262 --> 01:09:27,196
[bell dings]

1357
01:09:27,263 --> 01:09:29,098
[Seungheon] Round 1 has begun.

1358
01:09:29,799 --> 01:09:31,367
{\an8}ROUND 1 OF 6
YUK JUNSEO X CHO HYUNJAE

1359
01:09:31,434 --> 01:09:33,970
{\an8}Cho Hyunjae starts with light punches.

1360
01:09:34,037 --> 01:09:35,938
Nice shot from Yuk Junseo!

1361
01:09:36,005 --> 01:09:37,340
- There it is.
- See that?

1362
01:09:37,407 --> 01:09:39,208
You can't avoid every punch.

1363
01:09:39,275 --> 01:09:41,477
[♪ thrilling music playing]

1364
01:09:41,544 --> 01:09:44,480
[Junseo] <i>I threw a jab pretty early on,
and he got hit.</i>

1365
01:09:44,947 --> 01:09:47,116
<i>That's when I realized,</i>

1366
01:09:48,051 --> 01:09:50,019
<i>it might not be impossible after all.</i>

1367
01:09:53,423 --> 01:09:57,627
[Gyuwon] He landed a heavy straight
with that lead hand.

1368
01:10:00,730 --> 01:10:02,799
[Dex]
I bet Cho Hyunjae's feeling the weight.

1369
01:10:02,865 --> 01:10:04,867
[Jongkook] He's probably never felt
shots like that before.

1370
01:10:04,934 --> 01:10:06,869
[Dex] Right, he throws with raw power.

1371
01:10:07,637 --> 01:10:09,405
- It's all instinct, you know.
- [ref in English] Stop.

1372
01:10:12,041 --> 01:10:14,010
[brother] Hyunjae, use your footwork.

1373
01:10:14,077 --> 01:10:15,111
No holding.

1374
01:10:15,178 --> 01:10:17,180
[Hyunjae] <i>I was a bit caught off guard.</i>

1375
01:10:17,246 --> 01:10:19,115
- [in English] Box!
- [♪ tense music playing]

1376
01:10:19,182 --> 01:10:22,485
[Hyunjae] <i>I'd fought him before,
so I thought I had a read on his style,</i>

1377
01:10:22,552 --> 01:10:26,089
<i>but he opened
with a completely different approach.</i>

1378
01:10:26,155 --> 01:10:27,390
<i>That caught me off guard.</i>

1379
01:10:28,991 --> 01:10:33,896
[Junseo] <i>I plan to be really aggressive
in the clinch.</i>

1380
01:10:34,464 --> 01:10:36,833
That kind of grabbing
should really rattle him up.

1381
01:10:37,867 --> 01:10:39,802
[spectator 5]
Nice, he's pretty tense right now!

1382
01:10:43,773 --> 01:10:45,341
[Seungheon] Coming in, Yuk Junseo.

1383
01:10:49,412 --> 01:10:50,847
[♪ tense music playing]

1384
01:10:50,913 --> 01:10:52,715
[spectator 6] All right! Doing good!

1385
01:10:53,316 --> 01:10:54,951
All right! Doing good!

1386
01:10:56,252 --> 01:10:57,720
[Lee] Counters like that.

1387
01:10:58,421 --> 01:11:00,690
- They're big if you walk into them.
- Exactly.

1388
01:11:00,757 --> 01:11:01,824
Nice shot!

1389
01:11:02,325 --> 01:11:03,326
[ref] Break it up!

1390
01:11:07,630 --> 01:11:08,865
[spectator 5] Guard up, man!

1391
01:11:12,502 --> 01:11:14,370
[Gyuwon]
After Yuk Junseo took that one shot,

1392
01:11:14,437 --> 01:11:15,838
he's struggling to find his range.

1393
01:11:15,905 --> 01:11:17,974
That's right!
And that's when you need composure.

1394
01:11:18,541 --> 01:11:20,676
[Gyuwon] Yuk Junseo,
now carefully putting up his guard.

1395
01:11:22,111 --> 01:11:25,281
- [Lee] That right hand's all Junseo's got.
- [Jongkook] You're right.

1396
01:11:25,348 --> 01:11:26,549
[coach] Guard up!

1397
01:11:27,216 --> 01:11:29,118
[Dex]
He just needs to drive it in with power.

1398
01:11:29,185 --> 01:11:30,853
It all depends on that one shot.

1399
01:11:34,924 --> 01:11:36,159
He's not gonna get caught.

1400
01:11:37,927 --> 01:11:40,129
Wait, he got caught? For real?

1401
01:11:42,632 --> 01:11:45,034
Ha, ha, ha. See, I told you!

1402
01:11:45,101 --> 01:11:46,369
[gasps]

1403
01:11:50,540 --> 01:11:52,275
He's totally found his rhythm.
This is bad.

1404
01:11:52,341 --> 01:11:53,676
Yes, that's it!

1405
01:11:53,743 --> 01:11:57,046
[Gyuwon]
Look at that unpredictable explosiveness!

1406
01:11:57,113 --> 01:11:59,115
Cho Hyunjae won't like that at all.

1407
01:11:59,649 --> 01:12:00,650
Damn it!

1408
01:12:00,716 --> 01:12:02,185
Man, this one's hard to tell.

1409
01:12:02,251 --> 01:12:04,187
{\an8}[Dex] Striker, Lee Gijun!
Prince, Lee Chaehyun!

1410
01:12:04,754 --> 01:12:06,622
That's it, one-two! Nice!

1411
01:12:06,689 --> 01:12:09,091
[audience exclaiming]

1412
01:12:10,359 --> 01:12:11,727
Go for it!

1413
01:12:12,595 --> 01:12:13,729
He's fast.

1414
01:12:14,864 --> 01:12:16,299
[ref] Down!

1415
01:12:16,365 --> 01:12:18,534
- Keep going, keep going!
- Whoa!

1416
01:12:18,601 --> 01:12:20,102
{\an8}[Dex] Thunder, Kwon Ohgon!

1417
01:12:20,169 --> 01:12:21,737
{\an8}Tyson, Hong Sungmin!

1418
01:12:23,372 --> 01:12:25,007
[audience shouting]

1419
01:12:25,074 --> 01:12:26,676
- Come on!
- Don't let him hit you!

1420
01:12:27,143 --> 01:12:29,846
[Lee]
He's fighting on a one-percent chance.

1421
01:12:31,247 --> 01:12:32,882
[Hyunjae] <i>I'll fight to the end and win,
no matter what.</i>

1422
01:12:32,949 --> 01:12:35,117
[Lee] The winner of this match is...

1423
01:12:35,184 --> 01:12:37,186
[♪ rhythmic music playing]

1424
01:12:49,198 --> 01:12:51,334
[♪ theme song playing]

1425
01:12:56,072 --> 01:12:58,074
Translated by Jisu Park

